-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1ב', §1.26 השתלמות עובדי הוראה
-- Further training of teaching employees: when trainings are planned (1.26.0);
-- the further-training allowance (gmul hishtalmut) — its history, who earns
-- it, its kinds and their size, what training counts and how hours become
-- units, the units the personnel departments grant, the double-degree and
-- intermediate allowances, and the procedure (1.26.1); study grants (1.26.2);
-- and the training funds (1.26.3).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

@desc The actors of section 1.26: the takanon's shared parties, and the bodies this section names that the shared list lacks.
DECLARE `1.26 party` IS ONE OF
    `takanon party` HAS `the shared party` IS A Party
    `the training department`
    `the units and the national subject supervisors`
    `the district training supervisor`
    `the teaching personnel division`
    `the district personnel department`
    `the professional development division`
    `the exceptions committee`
    `the retroactive-payment committee`
    `the pensions administration`
    `the district treasury`
    `the Open University`
    `the fund management`
    `the training fund`

`the teacher`     MEANS `takanon party` `the teaching employee`
`the employer`    MEANS `takanon party` `the employer`
`the ownership`   MEANS `takanon party` `the local authority or owning body`
`the ministry`    MEANS `takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`

-- Dates across years are year-month-day numbers (19940901). Times inside a
-- school year are school months (September = 1, as in common.l4).

@desc What a party does under section 1.26.
DECLARE `training action` IS ONE OF
    `take part in a training during working hours`
    `publish the fixed training days`
    `send the approval where 1.26.1.5א routes it` HAS `approval destination` IS A STRING
    `confirm the total units on part B of the form`
    `send the final approval`
    `report the cancelled units to the training supervisor`
    `set an effective date` HAS `effective month` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the first grant instalment` HAS `first instalment month` IS A NUMBER
    `report the grants paid` HAS `report month` IS A NUMBER
    `settle the final account` HAS `settlement month` IS A NUMBER
    `deliver the transcript` HAS `transcript month` IS A NUMBER
    `refund the tuition` HAS `refund month` IS A NUMBER
    `notify a change in the study plan`
    `stop the grant`
    `apply to the exceptions committee` HAS `exceptions application month` IS A NUMBER
    `pay into the training fund` HAS `fund payment month` IS A NUMBER
    `leave the teaching service` HAS `months after the leave` IS A NUMBER
    `repay the fund`
    `appeal the repayment`

§ `1.26 השתלמות עובדי הוראה`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26/p6 The page's table of contents: the headings of 1.26.0-1.26.3, which carry no rule of their own.

§§ `1.26.0 הנחיות להפעלת השתלמויות לעובדי הוראה`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0/p1
`the planning guidelines apply from` MEANS 19991201

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0/p2 Introduces the guidelines of the training administration that follow.

-- 1.26.0א: trainings are planned for these times.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0__para_a
DECLARE `time for a training` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0__para_a/p2
    `vacation days of the school year or the summer vacation`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0__para_a/p3
    `afternoon or evening, from 15:00`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0__para_a/p4
    `the teachers' "free days"`

GIVEN t IS A `time for a training`, `starts at hour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a training may be planned for` t `starts at hour` IF
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `afternoon or evening, from 15:00` THEN `starts at hour` AT LEAST 15
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 1.26.0ב: no training in the teacher's own working hours, save the
-- concentrated courses of the school for senior teachers and the trainings of
-- the Shlomi and Beit Yatziv centres — and those with the principal's and the
-- general supervisor's approval.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0__para_b
DECLARE `training in working hours` HAS
    `is a concentrated course of the school for senior teachers` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is at the Shlomi or Beit Yatziv centre`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the principal approved`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the general supervisor approved`         IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN w IS A `training in working hours`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may take part during working hours` w IF
        (w's `is a concentrated course of the school for senior teachers` OR w's `is at the Shlomi or Beit Yatziv centre`)
    AND w's `the principal approved`
    AND w's `the general supervisor approved`

GIVEN w IS A `training in working hours`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `no training in working hours` w IS
    IF `may take part during working hours` w
    THEN PARTY `the teacher` MAY `take part in a training during working hours`
    ELSE PARTY `the teacher` SHANT `take part in a training during working hours`

-- 1.26.0ג is a recommendation ("מומלץ") to the units and the national
-- subject supervisors (המפמ"רים), written as a permission.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `publishing the fixed training days` IS
    PARTY `the units and the national subject supervisors`
    MAY   `publish the fixed training days`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_0/p4 The source of 1.26.0 (אסמכתא): a director-general circular.

§§ `1.26.1.0 גמול השתלמות — מבוא`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0/p1 The introduction's heading ("in the past, present and future"); its rules follow.

-- 1.26.1.0א, the old rules (1.9.61-31.8.84): at most three old allowances,
-- for a degree and a teaching certificate, or for a structured course of
-- 350 hours or courses of 450 hours in all; 15 credit units made one
-- allowance and fewer made none; a fixed monthly sum per allowance.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_a
GIVEN `credit units` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `old-rules allowances for credit units` `credit units` IS
    min 3 (TRUNC (`credit units` DIVIDED BY 15) 0)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_a
GIVEN `a seminary certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the teaching certificate is a seminary one (else a secondary one)
      `date` IS A NUMBER @desc year-month-day, under the old rules (to 31.8.84)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a degree and a teaching certificate earned an old-rules allowance` `a seminary certificate` `date` IF
        `date` AT MOST 19840831
    AND `date` AT LEAST (IF `a seminary certificate` THEN 19821101 ELSE 19610901)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_a
GIVEN `hours of one structured course` IS A NUMBER, `hours of all courses` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `courses earned an old-rules allowance` `hours of one structured course` `hours of all courses` IF
    `hours of one structured course` AT LEAST 350 OR `hours of all courses` AT LEAST 450

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_a
`the old-rules allowance was a fixed monthly sum, set from time to time` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.26.1.0ב: from 1.9.84 to 30.9.87 percentages; an old allowance = 4 new;
-- at most 12; the first 6 gave 1% each of the combined salary, the next 6
-- gave 0.5%; so at most 9%.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_b
GIVEN `old allowances` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `new allowances for old ones` `old allowances` IS `old allowances` TIMES 4

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_b
GIVEN `units` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `percent of the combined salary in 1984-1987` `units` IS
         min (min `units` 12) 6 TIMES 1
    PLUS max 0 (min `units` 12 MINUS 6) TIMES 0.5

#ASSERT `percent of the combined salary in 1984-1987` 12 EQUALS 9
#ASSERT `percent of the combined salary in 1984-1987` 20 EQUALS 9

-- 1.26.1.0ג-י: the regimes since 1.10.87, each with its ceiling on regular
-- units, the double-degree and intermediate units, and the percent a unit
-- earns of the combined salary.
@desc One period of the training allowance's history (1.26.1.0ג-י).
DECLARE `allowance regime` HAS
    `regime from`               IS A NUMBER
    `regime until`              IS A NUMBER
    `regular units ceiling`     IS A NUMBER
    `regime double-degree units` IS A NUMBER
    `regime intermediate units`  IS A NUMBER
    `percent per unit`          IS A NUMBER

`the allowance regimes` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_c
        `allowance regime` 19871001 19890331 10 5    0 1,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_d
        `allowance regime` 19890401 19910331 10 6.5  3 1,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_e
        `allowance regime` 19910401 19930831 10 6.5  3 1.2,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_f
        `allowance regime` 19930901 19940831 12 8.75 4 1.2,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_g
        `allowance regime` 19940901 19950831 13 8.75 4 1.2,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_h
        `allowance regime` 19950901 19960831 14 8.75 4 1.2,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_i
        `allowance regime` 19960901 19970831 15 8.75 4 1.2,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0__para_j
        `allowance regime` 19970901 99991231 16 8.75 4 1.2

GIVEN r IS A `allowance regime`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most units of a regime` r IS
    r's `regular units ceiling` PLUS max (r's `regime double-degree units`) (r's `regime intermediate units`)

GIVEN r IS A `allowance regime`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most percent of a regime` r IS
    `the most units of a regime` r TIMES r's `percent per unit`

-- The regimes reproduce the totals the introduction states: 15%, 16.5%,
-- 19.8%, and 20.75, 21.75, 22.75, 23.75, 24.75 units.
#ASSERT map `the most percent of a regime` (take 3 `the allowance regimes`) EQUALS LIST 15, 16.5, 19.8
#ASSERT map `the most units of a regime` (drop 3 `the allowance regimes`) EQUALS LIST 20.75, 21.75, 22.75, 23.75, 24.75
#ASSERT 10 PLUS 3 EQUALS 13

GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `allowance regime`
DECIDE `the regime on` `date` IS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD `date` AT LEAST r's `regime from` AND `date` AT MOST r's `regime until`) `the allowance regimes`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_0/p3 The source of 1.26.1.0 (אסמכתא): a special director-general circular.

§§ `1.26.1.1 כללי`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_a
`earlier instructions on the training allowance still apply` MEANS FALSE

-- 1.26.1.1(1)ב: a training fund's approval for a sabbatical is not a grant of
-- the allowance; sabbatical studies earn it only on the criteria and with
-- the training department's official approval.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN `meets the criteria` IS A BOOLEAN, `the training department approved officially` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sabbatical studies earn the allowance` `meets the criteria` `the training department approved officially` IF
    `meets the criteria` AND `the training department approved officially`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_c
DECLARE `credential` IS ONE OF
    `certification to teach`
    `a permanent teaching licence`
    `the salary grade of a certified teacher`
    `another credential`

GIVEN c IS A `credential`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is "certification" or a "licence" in 1.26` c IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `certification to teach` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a permanent teaching licence` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 1.26.1.1(1)ד-ה: the allowance runs on the whole employment, above a full
-- position too; with several owners, each pays on its own share.
@desc A teacher's position with one owner.
DECLARE `position with an owner` HAS
    `owner name`                 IS A STRING
    `position fraction there`    IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_d akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_e
GIVEN `allowance percent` IS A NUMBER, `combined salary of a full position` IS A NUMBER, p IS A `position with an owner`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance an owner pays` `allowance percent` `combined salary of a full position` p IS
    `allowance percent` DIVIDED BY 100 TIMES `combined salary of a full position` TIMES p's `position fraction there`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_f
`the training allowance counts for severance and pension` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.26.1.1(1)ז: no two benefits for the same studies.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_g
DECLARE `benefit for studies` IS ONE OF
    `a salary grade`
    `regular training units`
    `the special-education supplement`
    `the counselling allowance`
    `the double-degree allowance`
    `the intermediate allowance`

GIVEN a IS A `benefit for studies`, b IS A `benefit for studies`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the same studies may earn both` a b IF
    a EQUALS b

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_1__subpara_h
GIVEN `the studies were then counted for a salary grade` IS A BOOLEAN, `day of the new grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance for those studies ends on` `the studies were then counted for a salary grade` `day of the new grade` IS
    IF `the studies were then counted for a salary grade` THEN `day of the new grade` ELSE 99991231

-- 1.26.1.1(2): who earns the allowance.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_b
DECLARE `workplace` IS ONE OF
    `a kindergarten`
    `an official or recognised primary school`
    `a middle school`
    `a post-primary institution`
    `grades 13-14 of a school for practical engineers or technicians`
    `a college or seminary for teachers and kindergarten teachers`
    `an adult-education institution`
    `a conservatory`
    `an instructional role, an instructor in a supervision post, or a supervisor`
    `the education department of a local authority`
    `another workplace`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as the allowance's eligibility asks.
DECLARE `allowance applicant` HAS
    `certified for some level of formal education in Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
    `certified abroad`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `completed Hebrew education`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `works at`                                             IS A `workplace`
    `graded on the teachers' scale`                        IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_a
GIVEN a IS A `allowance applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is certified as 1.26.1.1(2) requires` a IF
        a's `certified for some level of formal education in Israel`
    AND ((NOT a's `certified abroad`) OR a's `completed Hebrew education`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN a IS A `allowance applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is entitled to the allowance` a IF
    `is certified as 1.26.1.1(2) requires` a
    AND (CONSIDER a's `works at`
         WHEN `the education department of a local authority` THEN FALSE
         WHEN `another workplace` THEN FALSE
         OTHERWISE TRUE)

-- 1.26.1.1(2)ג: education-department staff of local authorities are not
-- entitled by their role, but the ministry handles their requests if they
-- are on the teachers' scale and certified — with no instruction to pay.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN a IS A `allowance applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ministry handles a local-authority employee's request` a IF
        a's `works at` EQUALS `the education department of a local authority`
    AND a's `graded on the teachers' scale`
    AND a's `certified for some level of formal education in Israel`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_c
`the education departments are instructed to pay those employees` MEANS FALSE

DECLARE `kind of allowance` IS ONE OF
    `the double-degree allowance kind`
    `the intermediate allowance kind`
    `regular units`

-- 1.26.1.1(2)ד: regular units only for studies or publications during or
-- after actual teaching that earned a year of seniority; the double-degree
-- and intermediate allowances also for studies before.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_d
GIVEN k IS A `kind of allowance`, `during or after teaching that earned a seniority year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the studies' time allows` k `during or after teaching that earned a seniority year` IF
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `regular units` THEN `during or after teaching that earned a seniority year`
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 1.26.1.1(2)ה: studies before certification count if they were not part of
-- its requirements and not counted for the grade; from the first of the
-- month after the certification (dates as year-month-day; month arithmetic
-- on the first of a month).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_e
GIVEN `part of the certification requirements` IS A BOOLEAN, `counted for the salary grade` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `pre-certification studies count` `part of the certification requirements` `counted for the salary grade` IF
    (NOT `part of the certification requirements`) AND (NOT `counted for the salary grade`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_2__subpara_e
GIVEN `year of certification` IS A NUMBER, `month of certification` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pre-certification studies earn from` `year of certification` `month of certification` IS
    IF `month of certification` EQUALS 12
    THEN (`year of certification` PLUS 1) TIMES 10000 PLUS 101
    ELSE `year of certification` TIMES 10000 PLUS (`month of certification` PLUS 1) TIMES 100 PLUS 1

#ASSERT `pre-certification studies earn from` 1995 12 EQUALS 19960101

-- 1.26.1.1(3): three kinds, and their size.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3/p1
`the kinds of allowance` MEANS LIST `the double-degree allowance kind`, `the intermediate allowance kind`, `regular units`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_a
`double-degree units` MEANS 8.75

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_b
`intermediate units` MEANS 4

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_a akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_b
GIVEN `double-degree allowances approved before` IS A NUMBER, `intermediate allowances approved before` IS A NUMBER, k IS A `kind of allowance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be approved` `double-degree allowances approved before` `intermediate allowances approved before` k IF
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `the double-degree allowance kind` THEN `double-degree allowances approved before` EQUALS 0
    WHEN `the intermediate allowance kind` THEN `intermediate allowances approved before` EQUALS 0 AND `double-degree allowances approved before` EQUALS 0
    WHEN `regular units` THEN TRUE

-- 1.26.1.1(3)ג: the ceiling on regular units — 13, raised to 14 from
-- 5756, 15 from 5757 and 16 from 5758 (the school years opening 1.9.95,
-- 1.9.96, 1.9.97); each unit earns 1.2% of the combined salary.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_c
GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the regular units ceiling on` `date` IS
    BRANCH IF `date` AT LEAST 19970901 THEN 16
           IF `date` AT LEAST 19960901 THEN 15
           IF `date` AT LEAST 19950901 THEN 14
           OTHERWISE 13

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_c
`percent of the combined salary per unit` MEANS 1.2

-- "In any case not more than 21.75" (F-1.26-a). Read as the ceiling of the
-- regime the sentence was written in (13 regular units), which moves with
-- the regular ceiling as the introduction (1.26.1.0ח-י) moves it.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_c
GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER, `regular` IS A NUMBER, `has the double-degree allowance` IS A BOOLEAN, `has the intermediate allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `allowance units` `date` `regular` `has the double-degree allowance` `has the intermediate allowance` IS
         min `regular` (`the regular units ceiling on` `date`)
    PLUS `units of the double-degree or intermediate allowance` `has the double-degree allowance` `has the intermediate allowance`

GIVEN `has the double-degree allowance` IS A BOOLEAN, `has the intermediate allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units of the double-degree or intermediate allowance` `has the double-degree allowance` `has the intermediate allowance` IS
    BRANCH IF `has the double-degree allowance` THEN `double-degree units`
           IF `has the intermediate allowance`  THEN `intermediate units`
           OTHERWISE 0

@export The further-training allowance (gmul hishtalmut) of section 1.26.1, as a percent of the combined salary, for a date, the regular units accumulated and the double-degree or intermediate allowance held
GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER @desc the date, as year-month-day (e.g. 19980901)
      `regular` IS A NUMBER @desc regular training units accumulated (section 1.26.1.2, 5)
      `has the double-degree allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the double-degree allowance (8.75 units) was approved
      `has the intermediate allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the intermediate allowance (4 units) was approved
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `training allowance percent` `date` `regular` `has the double-degree allowance` `has the intermediate allowance` IS
    `allowance units` `date` `regular` `has the double-degree allowance` `has the intermediate allowance`
        TIMES `percent of the combined salary per unit`

-- F-1.26-a: the "in any case" ceiling of 21.75 against the raised regular
-- ceiling: from 5758, 16 regular units and a double degree make 24.75.
`the most units from 5758` MEANS `allowance units` 19980901 16 TRUE FALSE

`the raised ceilings pass "in any case not more than 21.75"` MEANS
    `the most units from 5758` GREATER THAN 21.75
#ASSERT `the raised ceilings pass "in any case not more than 21.75"`
#ASSERT `the most units from 5758` EQUALS `the most units of a regime` (`allowance regime` 19970901 99991231 16 8.75 4 1.2)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1/p3 The sources of 1.26.1.1 (אסמכתא): director-general circulars.

§§ `1.26.1.2 גמולי השתלמות בטיפול גף ההשתלמות`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p2 Headings "4. גמולי השתלמות רגילים בטיפול גף ההשתלמות" and "א. השתלמויות מוכרות"; their rules follow.

-- 4א ¶1: a training counts if the teacher took an active part in at least
-- 80% of its hours and met its requirement within a month of its end — in
-- special cases up to a year.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p3
GIVEN `share of hours attended` IS A NUMBER, `months from the end to meeting the requirement` IS A NUMBER, `a special case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the participation counts` `share of hours attended` `months from the end to meeting the requirement` `a special case` IF
        `share of hours attended` AT LEAST 0.8
    AND (`months from the end to meeting the requirement` AT MOST 1
         OR (`a special case` AND `months from the end to meeting the requirement` AT MOST 12))

-- 4א: the recognised trainings, and which need recognition in advance.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p4
DECLARE `training provider` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p5
    `the training department of the ministry`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p6
    `the ministry of labour, approved by its training division`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p7
    `the Civil Service Commission, for the ministry's senior staff`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p8
    `regular degree studies at a recognised institution of higher education or its branch`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p8
    `external studies or a non-degree course of an institution of higher education`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p9
    `a regional college`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p10
    `a teacher-training institution`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p11
    `an academic course of the Open University`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p11
    `a non-academic course of the Open University`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p12
    `the school for senior teachers`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p13
    `the Shlomi training centre`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p14
    `the ministry's courses for principals`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p15
    `a recognised yeshiva`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p16
    `another institution or body`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p4
GIVEN p IS A `training provider`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `needs recognition in advance` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `external studies or a non-degree course of an institution of higher education` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a regional college` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a teacher-training institution` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a non-academic course of the Open University` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `another institution or body` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 4א(2): a labour-ministry training is recognised jointly by its appointee
-- and the ministry's training supervisor.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p6
`a labour-ministry training is recognised jointly by both ministries` MEANS TRUE

-- 4א(12): another body's training counts with recognition in advance under
-- the training department's guidelines and its confirmation the training
-- was carried out under them.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p16
GIVEN `recognised in advance under the guidelines` IS A BOOLEAN, `the department confirmed it was carried out` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `another body's training counts` `recognised in advance under the guidelines` `the department confirmed it was carried out` IF
    -- conditions (א) and (ב), each named below
    `recognised in advance under the guidelines` AND `the department confirmed it was carried out`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p17
`condition (א) of another body's training` MEANS "recognised in advance under the training department's guidelines"
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p18
`condition (ב) of another body's training` MEANS "the training department confirmed it was carried out under the guidelines"

-- 4א(12) ¶2: an institution for learners who are not teachers may offer 2
-- allowance courses a year with 500 to 1,000 such learners, and 4 with 1,000
-- and more — as printed, two bands that both hold 1,000 (F-1.26-b).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p19
DECLARE `courses band` HAS
    `from learners`        IS A NUMBER
    `to learners`          IS A NUMBER @desc 999999 stands for "and more"
    `courses a year`       IS A NUMBER

`the bands of courses for other institutions` MEANS
    LIST `courses band` 500  1000   2,
         `courses band` 1000 999999 4

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the courses the bands give for` n IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `courses a year`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from learners` AND n AT MOST b's `to learners`)
                `the bands of courses for other institutions`)

-- The reading adopted (F-1.26-b): 1,000 learners fall in the band that
-- opens at 1,000.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p19
GIVEN `learners who are not teachers` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `allowance courses an institution for others may offer` `learners who are not teachers` IS
    BRANCH IF `learners who are not teachers` AT LEAST 1000 THEN 4
           IF `learners who are not teachers` AT LEAST 500  THEN 2
           OTHERWISE 0

`the bands give 1,000 learners two numbers of courses` MEANS
    `the courses the bands give for` 1000 EQUALS LIST 2, 4
#ASSERT `the bands give 1,000 learners two numbers of courses`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD `the courses the bands give for` n EQUALS LIST (`allowance courses an institution for others may offer` n))
            (LIST 500, 750, 999, 1001, 5000)

-- 4א(13): school-based hours of 1.1.94-31.8.94 join the teacher's pool.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p20
GIVEN `date of the school-based hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `school-based hours join the pool` `date of the school-based hours` IF
    `date of the school-based hours` AT LEAST 19940101 AND `date of the school-based hours` AT MOST 19940831

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p21 Heading "ב. לימודים לקראת תואר אקדמי בארץ"; its rules follow.

@desc Studies towards a degree (4ב-ג).
DECLARE `degree studies` HAS
    `completed the degree`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `taught before them, earning a seniority year` IS A BOOLEAN
    `confirmation with passing grades`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `applied after receiving the degree`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `for an additional parallel degree`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a master's and studies for a doctorate, or holds a doctorate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `confirmation of meeting the requirements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `abroad`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `towards a degree`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `recognised in advance for the allowance` IS A BOOLEAN

-- 4ב(1): unfinished degree studies earn the allowance if (א) the teacher
-- taught before them and that earned a seniority year and (ב) a confirmation
-- with passing grades is produced; none without a grade, none applied for
-- after the degree — save regular units for an additional parallel degree.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p22
GIVEN d IS A `degree studies`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `unfinished degree studies earn the allowance` d IF
    -- conditions (א) and (ב), each named below
        d's `taught before them, earning a seniority year`
    AND d's `confirmation with passing grades`
    AND ((NOT d's `applied after receiving the degree`) OR d's `for an additional parallel degree`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p23
`condition (א) of unfinished degree studies` MEANS "the teacher taught before them, and that work earned a seniority year"
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p24
`condition (ב) of unfinished degree studies` MEANS "a confirmation with passing grades; academic studies without a grade earn nothing"

-- 4ב(2): for a master's holder studying for a doctorate, or a doctor, the
-- institution's confirmation that the requirements were met is a pass.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p25
GIVEN d IS A `degree studies`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has a passing grade` d IF
    d's `confirmation with passing grades`
    OR (d's `holds a master's and studies for a doctorate, or holds a doctorate` AND d's `confirmation of meeting the requirements`)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p26 Heading "ג. לימודים אקדמיים בחו\"ל"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p27 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p28
GIVEN d IS A `degree studies`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `studies abroad earn the allowance` d IF
    IF d's `towards a degree`
    THEN `unfinished degree studies earn the allowance` d
    ELSE d's `recognised in advance for the allowance`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p29
DECLARE `labour-ministry teacher abroad` HAS
    `the responsible supervisor's approval delivered in advance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `originals and Hebrew translations delivered on return` IS A BOOLEAN @desc naming the institution and its address, the subjects, the hours, the dates and the final grades

GIVEN l IS A `labour-ministry teacher abroad`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a labour-ministry teacher's training abroad is realised` l IF
    l's `the responsible supervisor's approval delivered in advance` AND l's `originals and Hebrew translations delivered on return`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p30 Heading "ד. השתלמות גננות"; its rules follow.

-- 4ד(1): until 5745 a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation
-- got the certified grade for 240 hours and the senior grade for 960; short
-- of the quota, or beyond it, the hours earn units — 112 to 239 hours
-- studied for the certified grade, and the hours from 241 to 959 studied for
-- the senior grade. (2): from 5746 the senior grade needs 720 hours; hours
-- short of it or beyond it earn units, from 1.9.87. (1) speaks only of a
-- certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation: for anyone else its
-- branch gives nothing.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p31 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p32
GIVEN `hours` IS A NUMBER, `from 5746` IS A BOOLEAN, `a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of a kindergarten teacher that earn units` `hours` `from 5746` `a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation` IS
    IF `from 5746`
    THEN IF `hours` LESS THAN 720 THEN `hours` ELSE `hours` MINUS 720
    ELSE IF (NOT `a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation`)
         THEN 0
         ELSE BRANCH IF `hours` LESS THAN 112 THEN 0
                     IF `hours` LESS THAN 240 THEN `hours`
                     IF `hours` LESS THAN 960 THEN `hours` MINUS 240
                     OTHERWISE `hours` MINUS 960

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p31
GIVEN `hours` IS A NUMBER, `a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher's grade until 5745` `hours` `a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation` IS
    IF (NOT `a certified kindergarten teacher without matriculation`)
    THEN "not under this rule"
    ELSE BRANCH IF `hours` AT LEAST 960 THEN "senior teacher"
                IF `hours` AT LEAST 240 THEN "certified teacher"
                OTHERWISE "no grade from these hours"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p32
`kindergarten units from 5746 run from` MEANS 19870901

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p33 Heading "ה. לימודים במסלול אישי"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p34
DECLARE `personal-track study` IS ONE OF
    `regular studies at an institution of higher education in Israel or abroad`
    `regular studies at a teacher-training college`
    `regular studies at a recognised yeshiva`
    `a training not recognised by the training department`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p36
    `external studies at an institution of higher education, not meant for teachers`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p35 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p36
GIVEN s IS A `personal-track study`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a personal-track study needs approval in advance` s IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `a training not recognised by the training department` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `external studies at an institution of higher education, not meant for teachers` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 4ה(3)-(4): the approval in advance — of the plan, its hours and the terms
-- — comes from the district training supervisor; for teachers of
-- teacher-training institutions and ministry supervisors, from the director
-- of the training department.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p36 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p37
GIVEN `teaches at a teacher-training institution or is a ministry supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `1.26 party`
DECIDE `who approves a personal-track plan` `teaches at a teacher-training institution or is a ministry supervisor` IS
    IF `teaches at a teacher-training institution or is a ministry supervisor`
    THEN `the training department`
    ELSE `the district training supervisor`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p38 Heading "ו. לימוד עצמי מודרך"; its rule follows.

@desc Guided self-study (4ו).
DECLARE `guided self-study` HAS
    `is certified`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `years of seniority`                 IS A NUMBER
    `research or writing in education, teaching or its methods` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the guide holds at least a master's` IS A BOOLEAN
    `structured guiding meetings through the year` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a written work of at least seminar level` IS A BOOLEAN
    `asked in detail before the studies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `delivered the written work with the guide's assessment and a report` IS A BOOLEAN
    `allowances the training staff grant` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 or 2, on the work's scope, its assessment and the number of guided meetings

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p39
GIVEN g IS A `guided self-study`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `allowances for guided self-study` g IS
    IF      g's `is certified`
        AND g's `years of seniority` AT LEAST 8
        AND g's `research or writing in education, teaching or its methods`
        AND g's `the guide holds at least a master's`
        AND g's `structured guiding meetings through the year`
        AND g's `a written work of at least seminar level`
        AND g's `asked in detail before the studies`
        AND g's `delivered the written work with the guide's assessment and a report`
    THEN max 1 (min 2 (g's `allowances the training staff grant`))
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p40
`guided self-study runs from` MEANS 19930901

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p41 Heading "ז. סדנאות לאמנות ולמלאכה"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p42
DECLARE `workshop teacher` IS ONE OF
    `a crafts teacher`
    `a special-education teacher`
    `a kindergarten teacher`
    `a teacher of grades 1-3`
    `another teacher`

-- 4ז: hours of art and craft workshops for teachers count in full for the
-- teachers (1) names; for others two workshop hours count one (a lecture
-- hour counts one); workshops not for teachers, recognised in advance on the
-- personal track, count two hours for one for everyone, and without that
-- recognition count nothing.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p42 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p43 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p44
GIVEN t IS A `workshop teacher`, `workshop hours` IS A NUMBER, `lecture hours` IS A NUMBER, `the workshop is meant for teachers` IS A BOOLEAN, `recognised in advance on the personal track` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `training hours from art and craft workshops` t `workshop hours` `lecture hours` `the workshop is meant for teachers` `recognised in advance on the personal track` IS
    `lecture hours` PLUS
        (BRANCH IF `the workshop is meant for teachers` AND (NOT t EQUALS `another teacher`)
                THEN `workshop hours`
                IF `the workshop is meant for teachers` OR `recognised in advance on the personal track`
                THEN `workshop hours` DIVIDED BY 2
                OTHERWISE 0)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p45 Heading "ח. לימודים לקראת תואר טכנאי או הנדסאי"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p46 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p47
DECLARE `technician studies` HAS
    `is a certified vocational instructor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `received the diploma`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `received a salary grade for them`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `after becoming a working teacher`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `official confirmation of hours and grades` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN t IS A `technician studies`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `technician or engineer studies earn units by hours` t IF
        t's `is a certified vocational instructor`
    AND (NOT t's `received a salary grade for them`)
    AND t's `after becoming a working teacher`
    AND (t's `received the diploma` OR t's `official confirmation of hours and grades`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p47
`institutions confirm partial technician studies once a year, at the end of each year` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p48 Heading "ט. השתלמות מעשית בתעשייה"; its rules follow.

@desc Practical training in industry (4ט).
DECLARE `industry training` HAS
    `teaches in technological education`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the field of specialisation`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `training hours in the plant`             IS A NUMBER
    `the professional and industry-programme supervisors approved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the plant's management approved`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the technological training supervisor approved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `beyond the hours with pupils in the plant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `guided by an instructor of the plant`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `met the supervisor's requirements`       IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p49
GIVEN i IS A `industry training`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `industry training earns the allowance` i IF
        i's `teaches in technological education`
    AND i's `in the field of specialisation`
    AND i's `training hours in the plant` AT LEAST 112
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p50
    AND `industry training was approved in advance` i
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p54
    AND i's `beyond the hours with pupils in the plant`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p55
    AND i's `guided by an instructor of the plant`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p56
    AND i's `met the supervisor's requirements`

GIVEN i IS A `industry training`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `industry training was approved in advance` i IF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p51
        i's `the professional and industry-programme supervisors approved`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p52
    AND i's `the plant's management approved`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p53
    AND i's `the technological training supervisor approved`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p57 Heading "י. גמול השתלמות בעד קורס לחינוך מיוחד"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p58
DECLARE `special-education qualification` IS ONE OF
    `a special-education certification course`
    `a seminary teaching certificate in special education`
    `a university degree in special education`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p58
GIVEN q IS A `special-education qualification`, `got the special-education supplement for it` IS A BOOLEAN, `left special for regular education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the special-education course may earn the allowance` q `got the special-education supplement for it` `left special for regular education` IF
        q EQUALS `a special-education certification course`
    AND `got the special-education supplement for it`
    AND `left special for regular education`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p59 Heading "יא. לימודים לקראת תעודת הסמכה נוספת"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p60
`courses towards an additional certification earn units by their hours` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p61 Heading "יב. לימודים המזכים בכפל תואר נוסף"; its rule follows.

-- 4יב (and 1.26.1.4, note 2): a teacher with the double-degree allowance who
-- studies for another earns units by the hours — or, instead, 4 regular
-- units from the teaching personnel division, not 8.75.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p62 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p56
GIVEN `units by the hours` IS A NUMBER, `asks the personnel division instead` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `regular units for an additional double degree` `units by the hours` `asks the personnel division instead` IS
    IF `asks the personnel division instead` THEN 4 ELSE `units by the hours`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p63 Heading "יג. קורס להכשרת מנהלים"; its rule follows.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p64
DECLARE `principals' course graduate` HAS
    `units by the course hours`           IS A NUMBER
    `fully certified before the course`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `course hours`                        IS A NUMBER
    `holds a senior certificate or grade, or a degree` IS A BOOLEAN
    `chooses the double degree`           IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN g IS A `principals' course graduate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may take the double degree for the principals' course` g IF
    g's `fully certified before the course` AND g's `course hours` AT LEAST 720 AND g's `holds a senior certificate or grade, or a degree`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p65 Heading "יד. לימודים באוניברסיטה הפתוחה"; its rules follow.

-- 4יד(1): a study unit giving a full academic credit point of the Open
-- University earns one unit; a half point counts 2 weekly hours, or 56
-- single hours, to be pooled (F-1.26-c on what a credit point is).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p66
GIVEN `full credit points` IS A NUMBER, `half credit points` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Open University units and pooled hours` `full credit points` `half credit points` IS
    `full credit points` TIMES 112 PLUS `half credit points` TIMES 56

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p67
GIVEN `recognised in advance for that year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-academic Open University course earns the allowance` `recognised in advance for that year` IF
    `recognised in advance for that year`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p67
`the Open University publishes the approved courses at the opening of the year` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p68 Heading "טו. לימודים בישיבות גבוהות מוכרות"; its rule follows.

-- 4טו: 8 weekly hours through a year ("זמנים" of that yeshiva) earn one
-- allowance, approved by the training supervisor on the head of the
-- yeshiva's confirmation on the form of annex 8.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p69
GIVEN `weekly hours through the year` IS A NUMBER, `the head confirmed the requirements were met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units from a yeshiva year` `weekly hours through the year` `the head confirmed the requirements were met` IS
    IF `the head confirmed the requirements were met`
    THEN TRUNC (`weekly hours through the year` DIVIDED BY 8) 0
    ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p70 Heading "טז. לימודים של עובד הוראה העומד לפרוש לגִמלאות"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p71
GIVEN `weekly hours before 1964` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units for studies before 1964 of one about to retire` `weekly hours before 1964` IS
    TRUNC (`weekly hours before 1964` DIVIDED BY 6) 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p72
GIVEN `about to retire` IS A BOOLEAN, `ungraded personal-track hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may ask the exceptions committee` `about to retire` `ungraded personal-track hours` IF
    `about to retire` AND `ungraded personal-track hours` AT LEAST 168

-- 4טז(3): a pensioner may ask the training department to examine trainings
-- before retirement; a positive decision goes through the personnel
-- division to the pensions administration, which decides whether and from
-- when it enters the pension.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p73
GIVETH A `1.26 party`
DECIDE `who decides whether a pensioner's units enter the pension` IS `the pensions administration`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p74 Heading "5. חישוב גמולי השתלמות רגילים (בטיפול גף ההשתלמות)"; its rules follow.

-- 5א: units are counted in training units. A unit is 112 single hours with
-- a passing grade; or 4 weekly yearly hours, or 8 weekly semester hours, at
-- an institution of higher education or of teacher training, with a passing
-- grade; or a year at a recognised yeshiva (4טו). So a weekly yearly hour is
-- 28 single hours and a weekly semester hour 14.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p75 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p76
`single hours in a unit` MEANS
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p77
    112

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p78
`weekly yearly hours in a unit` MEANS 4
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p79
`weekly semester hours in a unit` MEANS 8
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p80
`a recognised yeshiva's year is measured by 4טו` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN `weekly yearly hours` IS A NUMBER, `weekly semester hours` IS A NUMBER, `single hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `training hours` `weekly yearly hours` `weekly semester hours` `single hours` IS
       `weekly yearly hours` TIMES (`single hours in a unit` DIVIDED BY `weekly yearly hours in a unit`)
  PLUS `weekly semester hours` TIMES (`single hours in a unit` DIVIDED BY `weekly semester hours in a unit`)
  PLUS `single hours`

#ASSERT `training hours` 4 0 0 EQUALS 112
#ASSERT `training hours` 0 8 0 EQUALS 112

@desc One training, as section 5 counts it.
DECLARE `training` HAS
    `hours of the training`               IS A NUMBER @desc single hours (convert weekly hours with `training hours`)
    `hours with a passing grade`          IS A NUMBER @desc counting a grade split with another training only where both are on the same subject (5ב(1))
    `requirements confirmed met`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `ended on`                            IS A NUMBER @desc year-month-day
    `kind before 1.9.79`                  IS A `kind of early study`
    `ungraded, in 5739-5746`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `counted towards the senior teacher title` IS A BOOLEAN

@desc The trainings before 1.9.79 that still count (5ב).
DECLARE `kind of early study` IS ONE OF
    `not an exception`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p87
    `degree studies at an institution of higher education`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p88
    `studies towards practical engineer or technician`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p89
    `studies at a recognised yeshiva`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p90
    `recognised before 1.9.79 but short of the old minimum of 450 hours`

-- 5ב(3) and the cut-off: at least 14 hours; before 1.9.79 only the
-- exceptions (the last from 1.9.94).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p85 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p86
GIVEN t IS A `training`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the training is recognised` t IF
        t's `hours of the training` AT LEAST 14
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p84
    AND t's `requirements confirmed met`
    AND (t's `ended on` AT LEAST 19790901 OR (NOT t's `kind before 1.9.79` EQUALS `not an exception`))

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p90
`units for the short pre-1979 trainings run from` MEANS 19940901

-- 5ב(1): short trainings and the hours beyond whole units are pooled and
-- become units where a passing grade covers at least 56 of every 112 hours
-- (split between two graded trainings of one subject) — not when the hours
-- are pooled for the senior teacher title. 5ד: in 5739-5746 168 ungraded
-- hours earn a unit instead of 112 graded.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p81 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p82 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p83
GIVEN ts IS A LIST OF `training`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `regular units from trainings` ts IS
         TRUNC (min `pooled hours` (2 TIMES `pooled graded hours`) DIVIDED BY `single hours in a unit`) 0
    PLUS TRUNC (`ungraded hours of 5739-5746` DIVIDED BY 168) 0
    WHERE
        `counted` MEANS filter (GIVEN t YIELD `the training is recognised` t AND (NOT t's `counted towards the senior teacher title`)) ts
        `graded ones` MEANS filter (GIVEN t YIELD NOT t's `ungraded, in 5739-5746`) `counted`
        `pooled hours` MEANS sum (map (GIVEN t YIELD t's `hours of the training`) `graded ones`)
        `pooled graded hours` MEANS sum (map (GIVEN t YIELD t's `hours with a passing grade`) `graded ones`)
        `ungraded hours of 5739-5746` MEANS
            sum (map (GIVEN t YIELD t's `hours of the training`) (filter (GIVEN t YIELD t's `ungraded, in 5739-5746`) `counted`))

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p92 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p93
`ungraded hours a unit takes in 5739-5746` MEANS 168

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p94
`the 168-hour rule runs from` MEANS 19940201

-- 5ג: a long course earning more than one unit is assessed with one grade.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p91
`a course earning more than one unit is assessed with one overall grade` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p95 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p96 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p97 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_2/p98 The sources of 1.26.1.2 (אסמכתא): director-general circulars.

-- Worked example (placeholder trainings): a 112-hour graded course, a
-- 60-hour course graded on 30 hours, and a 70-hour course graded in full —
-- 242 hours, 212 graded: two units.
GIVEN `hours` IS A NUMBER, `graded` IS A NUMBER, `ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `training`
DECIDE `a graded training of` `hours` `graded` `ended` IS
    `training` WITH
        `hours of the training` IS `hours`
        `hours with a passing grade` IS `graded`
        `requirements confirmed met` IS TRUE
        `ended on` IS `ended`
        `kind before 1.9.79` IS `not an exception`
        `ungraded, in 5739-5746` IS FALSE
        `counted towards the senior teacher title` IS FALSE

`three trainings` MEANS
    LIST `a graded training of` 112 112 19950601,
         `a graded training of` 60  30  19960301,
         `a graded training of` 70  70  19970301

#ASSERT `regular units from trainings` `three trainings` EQUALS 2

§§ `1.26.1.3 גמולי השתלמות בטיפול מחלקות כוח-אדם בהוראה`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p2 Headings "6. גמולי השתלמות רגילים (בטיפול מחלקות כוח-אדם בהוראה)" and "א. לימודי הסמכה לחטיבת הביניים"; their rules follow.

-- 6א(1): a certified teacher who then finished a middle-school certification
-- course gets, besides the senior grade, units by the course's hours.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p3
GIVEN `course hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units for a middle-school certification course` `course hours` IS
    BRANCH
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p7
        IF `course hours` AT LEAST 1200 THEN 4
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p6
        IF `course hours` AT LEAST 1100 THEN 3
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p5
        IF `course hours` AT LEAST 1000 THEN 2
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p4
        IF `course hours` AT LEAST 900  THEN 1
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p8
        OTHERWISE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p8
GIVEN `course hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the course earns only the senior teacher title` `course hours` IF
    `course hours` LESS THAN 900

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p9 Heading "התחולה:"; the dates follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p10 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p11
GIVEN `certified on examinations` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `middle-school course units run from` `certified on examinations` IS
    IF `certified on examinations` THEN 19900301 ELSE 19860901

-- 6א(2): an academic or senior teacher who also finished such a course of
-- 1,200 hours or more gets the 4 units besides the double-degree allowance.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p12
GIVEN `academic or senior teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `course hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units besides the double degree for a middle-school course` `academic or senior teacher` `course hours` IS
    IF `academic or senior teacher` AND `course hours` AT LEAST 1200 THEN 4 ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p13 Heading "ב. שילוב לימודים פדגוגיים בלימודים אקדמיים בחו\"ל"; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p14
GIVEN `pedagogical courses` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units for pedagogical courses in a degree abroad` `pedagogical courses` IS
    BRANCH
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p18
        IF `pedagogical courses` AT LEAST 8 THEN 4
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p17
        IF `pedagogical courses` AT LEAST 6 THEN 3
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p16
        IF `pedagogical courses` AT LEAST 4 THEN 2
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p15
        IF `pedagogical courses` AT LEAST 3 THEN 1
        OTHERWISE 0

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p19 Heading "תחולת הזכאות"; the dates follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p20 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p21
GIVEN `graduated in Eastern Europe` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pedagogical-course units run from` `graduated in Eastern Europe` IS
    IF `graduated in Eastern Europe` THEN 19840901 ELSE 19880101

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p22 Heading "ג. עבודת מחקר או פרסום מדעי"; its rules follow.

@desc A work that a committee of the teaching personnel division weighs for units (6ג-ד).
DECLARE `creative work` HAS
    `work kind label`        IS A STRING
    `at most units`          IS A NUMBER
    `form number`            IS A STRING
    `work counted from`      IS A NUMBER @desc year-month-day; 0 where the text gives no date

-- 6ג(1): research or a scientific work published — unless it earned a grade
-- or a title — is weighed by a committee at its discretion, up to these.
`the research works` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p24
        `creative work` "a published book" 4 "050.202" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p25
        `creative work` "an article in a journal the committee recognised" 1 "050.202" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p26
        `creative work` "an audio or video tape of 30 minutes or more by a recognised public body" 1 "050.202" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p27
        `creative work` "a lecture at an international scientific congress" 1 "050.202" 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p23
GIVEN w IS A `creative work`, `the committee's assessment` IS A NUMBER, `the work earned a grade or a title` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units for a work` w `the committee's assessment` `the work earned a grade or a title` IS
    IF `the work earned a grade or a title`
    THEN 0
    ELSE max 0 (min (w's `at most units`) `the committee's assessment`)

DECLARE `work earning nothing` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p27
    `editing, compiling or translating`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p36
    `literary translation, criticism, a dictionary, compiling or editing`

-- 6ג(2) ¶2: no units for writing done in one's post (curricula, Mal"am,
-- Mata"h and the like); one teaching at least 2/3 of a position and writing
-- there at most 1/3 may apply, with confirmations from both workplaces.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p28
GIVEN `writes in his post` IS A BOOLEAN, `teaching share` IS A NUMBER, `writing share` IS A NUMBER, `confirmations from both workplaces` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may apply for units for writing study material` `writes in his post` `teaching share` `writing share` `confirmations from both workplaces` IF
    IF `writes in his post`
    THEN `teaching share` AT LEAST 2/3 AND `writing share` AT MOST 1/3 AND `confirmations from both workplaces`
    ELSE TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p28 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p72
`the ministry undertakes to return the publications and works` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p28 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p29
`the form for research and publication requests` MEANS "050.202 (annex 4)"

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p30 Heading "ד. פרסומים בתחום הספרות והאמנויות"; its rules follow.

-- 6ד: literature and the arts, weighed by the committee at its discretion
-- (unless the work earned a grade), up to these; the form and the date
-- each counts from.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p31
`the works of literature and the arts` MEANS
    LIST
        -- (1) literary works published by a public or private publisher, form 050.202, from 1.9.92
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p32 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p33 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p37 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p38
        `creative work` "a novel, a collection of poems, an essay or a play, published" 4 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p34
        `creative work` "a series of 5 books of stories for young children" 2 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p35
        `creative work` "a story in a recognised literary journal" 1 "050.202" 19920901,
        -- (2)(א) works shown in an exhibition, form 050.217, from 1.9.92
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p39 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p40 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p41
        `creative work` "a solo exhibition in a museum the committee recognised" 4 "050.217" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p42
        `creative work` "a group exhibition in a recognised museum, one work or more" 1 "050.217" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p43
        `creative work` "a solo exhibition in a recognised gallery with a curator or art committee" 4 "050.217" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p44
        `creative work` "four group exhibitions in a recognised gallery with a curator or art committee" 1 "050.217" 19920901,
        -- (2)(ב) publications in the plastic arts
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p45 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p46
        `creative work` "an album of original works by a recognised publisher" 4 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p47
        `creative work` "original illustration of a book, 10 illustrations at least" 2 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p48
        `creative work` "a monument in a public place chosen by a curator or art committee" 4 "050.217" 19920901,
        -- (3) music, form 050.202, from 1.9.92
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p50 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p51 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p56
        `creative work` "a work performed by an orchestra or professional players at a recognised centre" 4 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p52
        `creative work` "music for a film or a repertory or commercial theatre play" 4 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p53
        `creative work` "setting a collection of songs" 4 "050.202" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p54
        `creative work` "arrangements and orchestrations" 4 "050.202" 19920901,
        -- (4) direction and production in the theatre, form 050.217
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p57 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p58 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p63 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p64
        `creative work` "a play staged in a repertory theatre, or a screenplay of a released art film" 4 "050.217" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p59
        `creative work` "a play staged in a commercial theatre of the Israeli artists' union" 4 "050.217" 19940901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p60
        `creative work` "direction in a repertory theatre" 4 "050.217" 19940901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p61
        `creative work` "direction in a commercial theatre of the artists' union" 4 "050.217" 19940901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p62
        `creative work` "sets and costumes for such a play, or a city or national dance company's show" 4 "050.217" 19940901,
        -- (5) movement, dance and sport, form 050.217, from 1.9.92
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p65 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p66 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p70
        `creative work` "choreography for a city or national dance company" 4 "050.217" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p67
        `creative work` "directing or producing a mass show of movement or dance" 4 "050.217" 19920901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p68
        `creative work` "directing or producing a local or regional ceremony of 3 shows or more" 1 "050.217" 19920901

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p31
GIVEN w IS A `creative work`, `the committee's assessment` IS A NUMBER, `the work earned a salary grade` IS A BOOLEAN, `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units for a work of literature or art` w `the committee's assessment` `the work earned a salary grade` `date` IS
    IF `date` AT LEAST w's `work counted from`
    THEN `units for a work` w `the committee's assessment` `the work earned a salary grade`
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p36
`translation, criticism, a dictionary, compiling or editing earn units` MEANS FALSE

-- 6ד(3)(א): short musical works may be taken together, two or more for one
-- unit, at the committee's discretion.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p51
GIVEN `short works` IS A NUMBER, `the committee agrees` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `units for short musical works` `short works` `the committee agrees` IS
    IF `the committee agrees` AND `short works` AT LEAST 2 THEN 1 ELSE 0

-- What must go with each request.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p49
DECLARE `attachment` IS ONE OF
    `the museum's confirmation of works, dates, curator and catalogue`
    `photographs of all works, their names and dates, the gallery's confirmation, curator and catalogue`
    `the publications themselves`
    `confirmation of the placing and photographs from two angles, with the curator`
    `a detailed confirmation from the orchestra or theatre`
    `the set collection or the arrangements and orchestrations`
    `the work or written programme, the invitation and approval, or a video`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p49 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p55 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p69
GIVEN `item` IS A STRING
GIVETH A LIST OF `attachment`
DECIDE `what goes with a request for` `item` IS
    BRANCH IF `item` EQUALS "museum exhibition" THEN LIST `the museum's confirmation of works, dates, curator and catalogue`
           IF `item` EQUALS "gallery exhibition" THEN LIST `photographs of all works, their names and dates, the gallery's confirmation, curator and catalogue`
           IF `item` EQUALS "album or illustration" THEN LIST `the publications themselves`
           IF `item` EQUALS "monument" THEN LIST `confirmation of the placing and photographs from two angles, with the curator`
           IF `item` EQUALS "orchestral work or theatre music" THEN LIST `a detailed confirmation from the orchestra or theatre`
           IF `item` EQUALS "songs, arrangements or orchestrations" THEN LIST `the set collection or the arrangements and orchestrations`
           IF `item` EQUALS "movement, dance or sport" THEN LIST `the work or written programme, the invitation and approval, or a video`
           OTHERWISE EMPTY

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p71 Heading "הערה:"; its rule (the ministry does not undertake to return works) is encoded with 6ג above.

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p73 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_3/p74 The source of 1.26.1.3 (אסמכתא): a special director-general circular.

§§ `1.26.1.4 גמול כפל תואר וגמול ביניים`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p1 Heading "7 גמול כפל תואר (בטיפול מחלקות כוח-אדם בהוראה)"; its rules follow.

@desc A way of meeting 1.26.1.4's conditions for the double-degree or the intermediate allowance, and the date it runs from.
DECLARE `allowance route` HAS
    `route letter`         IS A STRING
    `route description`    IS A STRING
    `route from`           IS A NUMBER @desc year-month-day; 0 where the text gives no date

-- 7: the routes to the double-degree allowance of 8.75 units.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p2
`the double-degree routes` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p3
        `allowance route` "א" "a degree and a university school of education's teaching certificate for post-primary schools" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p4
        `allowance route` "ב" "a recognised degree from abroad and a recognised university's teaching certificate for kindergarten to grade 12" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p6
        `allowance route` "ג" "a degree from abroad with pedagogical studies certifying there, after Hebrew education and certification in Israel" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p8
        `allowance route` "ד" "a B.Ed of a recognised college of education, or a Mus. B.Ed of the Jerusalem Academy of Music" 19870901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p9 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p10
        `allowance route` "ה" "an equivalent academic grade, matriculation and a teacher-training certificate" 19960901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p11 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p12
        `allowance route` "ה1" "an equivalent grade without matriculation, with a senior teacher's certificate not counted for the grade" 19960901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p13 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p14
        `allowance route` "ו" "a recognised degree and a college teaching certificate of 720 hours or more" 19821101,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p15
        `allowance route` "ז" "a recognised degree and a recognised seminary's certificate abroad, after high school or 13 years" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p16
        `allowance route` "ח" "a recognised degree and a certified vocational instructor's certificate of the inter-ministry committee" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p17
        `allowance route` "ט" "a Technion M.Sc. in teaching, or a Haifa, Oranim or Hebrew University degree with teaching" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p18 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p19
        `allowance route` "י" "a degree in education with a university's special-education specialisation for a permanent licence" 19870901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p20 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p21
        `allowance route` "יא" "a degree and the senior grade on 720 hours or more" 19960901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p22 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p23
        `allowance route` "יב" "a recognised degree and the ministry's principals' course, fully certified before it" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p24 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p25
        `allowance route` "יג" "a degree and a French CAPES certificate, with Hebrew education completed" 19900301,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p26 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p27
        `allowance route` "יד" "a degree and a 'teacher for the diaspora' certificate, with the examinations for full certification" 19900301,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p28 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p29
        `allowance route` "טו" "a recognised degree and an 'engineers for teaching' certificate" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p30 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p31
        `allowance route` "טז" "a recognised degree and a teaching certificate of a conversion course for graduates of 720 hours" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p32 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p33
        `allowance route` "יז" "a recognised degree and a practical-engineer or technician certificate for teaching" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p34
        `allowance route` "יח" "a degree and the senior grade on a middle-school certification course of 720 hours" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p35 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p36
        `allowance route` "יט" "an equivalent academic grade without matriculation, with two parallel teaching certificates, one counted" 19920501,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p37
        `allowance route` "כ" "a recognised degree and a second parallel degree received, or an equivalent parallel grade" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p38
        `allowance route` "כא" "a senior title of a teacher-training institution and a second senior certificate of another" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p39
        `allowance route` "כב" "two parallel certified-teacher titles of recognised teacher-training institutions" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p40
        `allowance route` "כג" "a senior title of a teacher-training institution and a parallel senior grade" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p41
        `allowance route` "כד" "the senior grade on the principals' course, fully certified before it, and a senior grade on 720 hours" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p42
        `allowance route` "כה" "the senior grade on a joint middle-school certification course and a senior grade on 720 hours" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p43
        `allowance route` "כו" "the senior grade on practical-engineer titles of Mahat and a senior grade on 720 hours" 0,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p44 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p45
        `allowance route` "כז" "a certified vocational instructor's certificate and a seminary or college teaching certificate" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p46 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p47
        `allowance route` "כח" "a certified vocational instructor's certificate and the senior grade on 720 hours" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p48 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p49
        `allowance route` "כט" "a certified vocational instructor's certificate and a practical-engineer or technician certificate for teaching" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p50 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p51
        `allowance route` "ל" "a certified vocational instructor's certificate and certification to teach those subjects by an 'annex'" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p52 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p53
        `allowance route` "לא" "a degree or an equivalent grade, matriculation and a certificate of the Jerusalem school for educational leadership" 19940901

GIVEN routes IS A LIST OF `allowance route`
      `routes met` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a route is met by` routes `routes met` `date` IF
    any (GIVEN r YIELD elem (r's `route letter`) `routes met` AND `date` AT LEAST r's `route from`) routes

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p2
GIVEN `routes met` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the double-degree allowance` `routes met` `date` IF
    `a route is met by` `the double-degree routes` `routes met` `date`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p54 Heading "הערות"; the notes follow.

-- Note 1: a teacher-training institution's confirmation of finishing
-- certification studies is a teaching certificate for every purpose — the
-- double degree included — where the hours come to 720 or more.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p55
GIVEN `hours of the certification studies` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a confirmation of certification studies counts as a teaching certificate` `hours of the certification studies` IF
    `hours of the certification studies` AT LEAST 720

-- (Note 2, 4 regular units for an additional double degree, is encoded
-- with 4יב above, which states the same rule.)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p57 Heading "גמול ביניים (בטיפול מחלקות כוח-אדם בהוראה)"; its rules follow.

-- 8: the intermediate allowance, 4 units, once, and never with the double
-- degree.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p58
`the intermediate routes` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p59 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p60
        `allowance route` "א" "a recognised degree and a certified teacher's or kindergarten teacher's certificate on supplementary examinations" 19890401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p61 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p62
        `allowance route` "ב" "a recognised degree and a certified Shelach instructor's certificate on supplementary examinations" 19890401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p63 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p64
        `allowance route` "ג" "a recognised degree and the Mofet institute's confirmation of certification studies" 19900901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p65 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p66
        `allowance route` "ד" "an equivalent grade and matriculation, with such a certificate not counted for the grade" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p67 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p68
        `allowance route` "ה" "a recognised practical-engineer title and such a certificate on supplementary examinations" 19890401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p69 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p70
        `allowance route` "ו" "a Bezalel 'artist' or 'designer' certificate from before its recognition, and such a certificate" 19910401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p71 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p72
        `allowance route` "ז" "a recognised degree and a permanent teaching or instruction licence on supplementary studies" 19890401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p73 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p74 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p75 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p76
        `allowance route` "ח" "an equivalent grade and matriculation with a permanent licence, neither counted for the grade" 19910901,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p77 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p78
        `allowance route` "ט" "a recognised practical-engineer title and a permanent licence on examinations or 'practical engineer for teaching'" 19890401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p79 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p80
        `allowance route` "י" "a Bezalel certificate from before its recognition and a permanent licence on examinations" 19910401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p81 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p82
        `allowance route` "יא" "an ORT Anières (Geneva) certificate and a permanent licence on examinations" 19910401,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p83
        `allowance route` "יב" "a permanent teaching or instruction licence without conditions, within the agreed quotas" 19930901

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p58
GIVEN `routes met` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `date` IS A NUMBER
      `receives the double-degree allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `had the intermediate allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the intermediate allowance` `routes met` `date` `receives the double-degree allowance` `had the intermediate allowance` IF
        `a route is met by` `the intermediate routes` `routes met` `date`
    AND (NOT `receives the double-degree allowance`)
    AND (NOT `had the intermediate allowance`)

-- 8ח: the Beit Rivka and Beit Yaakov equivalent grade is not built on a
-- teaching licence, so with matriculation and a licence on examinations
-- they qualify.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p75
`a Beit Rivka or Beit Yaakov equivalent grade counts a teaching licence` MEANS FALSE

-- 8יב: the 1,000 allowances of the 1993 agreement are all granted, so no
-- application lies under them; the 250 + 250 of the 1994 agreements open to
-- applications once their criteria are published.
@desc A quota of intermediate allowances under 8יב.
DECLARE `intermediate quota` HAS
    `quota agreement`         IS A STRING
    `quota allowances`        IS A NUMBER
    `quota from`              IS A NUMBER
    `quota fully granted`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `quota criteria published` IS A BOOLEAN

`the intermediate quotas` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p84
        `intermediate quota` "11.5.93, 5754" 500 19930901 TRUE TRUE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p84
        `intermediate quota` "11.5.93, 5755" 500 19940901 TRUE TRUE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p85
        `intermediate quota` "31.8.94 and 19.9.94, 5755" 250 19940901 FALSE FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p85
        `intermediate quota` "31.8.94 and 19.9.94, 5756" 250 19950901 FALSE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p84 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p85
GIVEN q IS A `intermediate quota`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `one may apply under the quota` q IF
    (NOT q's `quota fully granted`) AND q's `quota criteria published`

#ASSERT sum (map (GIVEN q YIELD q's `quota allowances`) (take 2 `the intermediate quotas`)) EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT NOT any `one may apply under the quota` `the intermediate quotas`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p86 Heading "הערה"; its rule follows.

-- The note: no regular units for the studies that gave the licence on which
-- the intermediate allowance was granted — the middle-school course beyond
-- 720 hours, the pedagogical subjects of a degree abroad.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p87
GIVEN `the studies gave the licence of an intermediate allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the studies may earn regular units` `the studies gave the licence of an intermediate allowance` IF
    NOT `the studies gave the licence of an intermediate allowance`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p88
`a middle-school course that gave the licence earns the senior grade and the intermediate allowance, not units beyond 720 hours` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p89
`pedagogical subjects abroad that gave the licence earn the academic grade and the intermediate allowance, not units` MEANS TRUE

-- F-1.26-d: the references from 3ג and 7 into section 4 are one letter
-- short: each names a sub-clause whose neighbour holds the subject.
DECLARE `letter citation` HAS
    `cited from`          IS A STRING
    `letter cited`        IS A NUMBER
    `letter of the subject` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p23 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p41 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p56 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_1__para_3__subpara_c
`the citations into section 4` MEANS
    LIST `letter citation` "3ג: an additional double degree (4יא)"                     11 12,
         `letter citation` "7יב: the principals' course (4י\"ב)"                       12 13,
         `letter citation` "7כד: full certification before the principals' course (4 יב)" 12 13,
         `letter citation` "7, note 2: an additional double degree (4יא)"             11 12

`every citation into section 4 is one letter short` MEANS
    all (GIVEN c YIELD c's `letter of the subject` EQUALS c's `letter cited` PLUS 1) `the citations into section 4`
#ASSERT `every citation into section 4 is one letter short`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p90 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p91 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p92 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p93 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p94 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p95 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_4/p96 The sources of 1.26.1.4 (אסמכתא): director-general and personnel-division circulars.

#ASSERT `entitled to the double-degree allowance` (LIST "יא") 19960901
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the double-degree allowance` (LIST "יא") 19960801
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the intermediate allowance` (LIST "ז") 19950101 TRUE FALSE

§§ `1.26.1.5 הוראות נוהל וביצוע`

-- 1.26.1.5א: where the training department's approvals for section 4 go.
@desc Where an employee's allowance papers are handled (1.26.1.5א, ד, ה, ח).
DECLARE `employee category` IS ONE OF
    `an official teacher paid through the district office`
    `a post-primary teacher of the district`
    `a post-primary teacher of the northern district, or of settlement education`
    `a teacher in independent education`
    `a supervisor`
    `a teacher at a teacher-training institution`
    `an adult-education teacher`
    `an employee of a recognised non-official institution`
    `an employee outside the district or of unclear affiliation`

-- A teacher of a recognised non-official institution is one of the "other
-- teachers ... belonging to the district" the paragraph names, unless it is
-- independent education or outside the district, which it names apart.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `employee category`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `where the training department's approval goes` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `an official teacher paid through the district office` THEN "the district's teaching personnel department"
    WHEN `a post-primary teacher of the district` THEN "the district's teaching personnel department"
    WHEN `a post-primary teacher of the northern district, or of settlement education` THEN "the grading and certification branch, Jerusalem"
    WHEN `a teacher in independent education` THEN "the recognised-education division, Jerusalem"
    WHEN `a supervisor` THEN "the human-resources branch"
    WHEN `a teacher at a teacher-training institution` THEN "the teaching personnel department of the teacher-training branch"
    WHEN `an adult-education teacher` THEN "the adult-education division's personnel officer in the district"
    WHEN `an employee of a recognised non-official institution` THEN "the district's teaching personnel department"
    WHEN `an employee outside the district or of unclear affiliation` THEN "the employee, to bring to the employer who pays the salary"

-- 1.26.1.5ב: a personal-track request goes to the district training
-- supervisor on the annex 2 form, with the institution's official
-- confirmation; 4(ה)3 needs approval in advance; papers in a foreign
-- language other than English need a certified Hebrew translation.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_b
DECLARE `personal-track request` HAS
    `on the annex 2 form`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `confirmation with name, ID, subjects, hours, requirements, grade, place and dates` IS A BOOLEAN
    `under 4(ה)3`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved in advance by the training supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in a foreign language other than English` IS A BOOLEAN
    `with a certified Hebrew translation`     IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN r IS A `personal-track request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the personal-track request is complete` r IF
        r's `on the annex 2 form`
    AND r's `confirmation with name, ID, subjects, hours, requirements, grade, place and dates`
    AND ((NOT r's `under 4(ה)3`) OR r's `approved in advance by the training supervisor`)
    AND ((NOT r's `in a foreign language other than English`) OR r's `with a certified Hebrew translation`)

-- ב ¶2: the approval goes on to the districts "as detailed in א" — to
-- wherever 1.26.1.5א routes the teacher's approvals.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_b/p2
GIVEN c IS A `employee category`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `sending a personal-track approval on` c IS
    PARTY `the district training supervisor`
    MUST  `send the approval where 1.26.1.5א routes it` d
          PROVIDED d EQUALS `where the training department's approval goes` c

-- 1.26.1.5ג: the personnel units confirm the total units on part B of the
-- annex 1 form; one copy to the teacher, one to the treasury (official
-- teachers) or the owner.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `confirming the total units` IS
    PARTY `the district personnel department`
    MUST  `confirm the total units on part B of the form`
    HENCE (PARTY `the district personnel department` MUST `send the final approval`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_c
GIVEN `an official teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `1.26 party`
DECIDE `who gets the second copy for payment` `an official teacher` IS
    IF `an official teacher` THEN `the district treasury` ELSE `the ownership`

-- 1.26.1.5ד: a section 6 claim goes to the employing owner; official
-- teachers (kindergarten, primary, middle school, Shelach) send it to the
-- district personnel department, adult education to its district personnel
-- officer, teacher-training institutions to the teacher-training branch,
-- supervisors to human resources, and recognised non-official institutions
-- — and anyone the paragraph does not name — to the employing owner.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_d
GIVEN c IS A `employee category`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `where a section 6 claim goes` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `an official teacher paid through the district office` THEN "the district's teaching personnel department"
    WHEN `an adult-education teacher` THEN "the adult-education division's personnel officer in the district"
    WHEN `a teacher at a teacher-training institution` THEN "the teacher-training branch"
    WHEN `a supervisor` THEN "the human-resources branch"
    OTHERWISE "the employing owner"

-- ד ¶2: an owner that wants the ministry's determination forwards the claim
-- on form 050.209 — to the district personnel departments or the
-- teacher-training branch; owners under settlement education or the northern
-- district to the grading and certification branch in Jerusalem; the
-- independent education centre to the recognised-education division.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_d/p2
GIVEN c IS A `employee category`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `where the owner forwards a section 6 claim` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a post-primary teacher of the northern district, or of settlement education` THEN "the grading and certification branch, Jerusalem"
    WHEN `a teacher in independent education` THEN "the recognised-education division, Jerusalem"
    WHEN `a teacher at a teacher-training institution` THEN "the teacher-training branch"
    OTHERWISE "the teaching personnel department of the district (Jerusalem, South, Centre, Tel Aviv or Haifa)"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_d/p2
GIVEN `item of section 6` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the form for a section 6 claim` `item of section 6` IS
    BRANCH IF `item of section 6` EQUALS "6א" THEN "a letter with the certificates"
           IF `item of section 6` EQUALS "6ב" THEN "a letter with the certificates"
           IF `item of section 6` EQUALS "6ד(2)(א)" THEN "050.217"
           IF `item of section 6` EQUALS "6ד(2)(ב)3" THEN "050.217"
           IF `item of section 6` EQUALS "6ד(4)" THEN "050.217"
           IF `item of section 6` EQUALS "6ד(5)" THEN "050.217"
           OTHERWISE "050.202"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_d/p2
`requests go only by the procedure set out` MEANS TRUE

-- 1.26.1.5ה: double-degree and intermediate requests of official teachers go
-- to the personnel department; of non-official ones to the owner, who may
-- ask the ministry's determination; given on part B of annex 1, on forms
-- 050.213 / 050.214, or by letter.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_e akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_e/p2
GIVEN c IS A `employee category`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `where a double-degree or intermediate request goes` c IS `where a section 6 claim goes` c

-- 1.26.1.5ו: no two benefits for the same studies: units for partial
-- studies end when the degree and its grade come; a senior grade on partial
-- degree studies that earned the double degree likewise.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_f
GIVEN `units were for partial studies of the degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `the degree and its grade were granted` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the units for the partial studies are cancelled` `units were for partial studies of the degree` `the degree and its grade were granted` IF
    `units were for partial studies of the degree` AND `the degree and its grade were granted`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_f/p2
`the "senior" grade certificate earns the double degree once the academic grade is approved` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_f/p2
GIVEN `units were cancelled for a grade or the special-education supplement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `reporting cancelled units` `units were cancelled for a grade or the special-education supplement` IS
    IF `units were cancelled for a grade or the special-education supplement`
    THEN PARTY `the district personnel department`
         MUST  `report the cancelled units to the training supervisor`
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_f/p2
`a salary grade may be cancelled to convert it into units` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_f/p3
`excess grading points earn units` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_f/p3
`a second senior certificate on 720 hours earns the double degree` MEANS FALSE

-- 1.26.1.5ז: the personnel units set the effective date, never in July or
-- August — save retirees at the end of August and teachers going on a
-- fund sabbatical (from 1 August), and supervisors, who work then.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_g
GIVEN `school month` IS A NUMBER, `retires at the end of August or goes on a fund sabbatical` IS A BOOLEAN, `is a supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the effective date may fall in` `school month` `retires at the end of August or goes on a fund sabbatical` `is a supervisor` IF
    IF `school month` EQUALS 11
    THEN `is a supervisor`
    ELSE IF `school month` EQUALS 12
         THEN `is a supervisor` OR `retires at the end of August or goes on a fund sabbatical`
         ELSE TRUE

-- 1.26.1.5ח: a retroactive request goes to the employer — (1) official
-- teachers (kindergarten, primary, middle school, Shelach) to the district
-- personnel units, teacher-training institutions to their branch,
-- supervisors to human resources, adult education to its district officer;
-- (2) non-official teachers paid by the owner to the owner.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_h akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_h__subpara_1
GIVEN c IS A `employee category`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `where a retroactive request goes` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `an official teacher paid through the district office` THEN "the district's teaching personnel units"
    WHEN `a teacher at a teacher-training institution` THEN "the teacher-training branch"
    WHEN `a supervisor` THEN "the human-resources branch"
    WHEN `an adult-education teacher` THEN "the adult-education division's personnel officer in the district"
    OTHERWISE "the owner, which may refer it to the retroactive-payment committee"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_h__subpara_2
GIVEN `the request came from the employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the retroactive-payment committee handles the request` `the request came from the employer` IF
    `the request came from the employer`

-- 1.26.1.5ח(2): the owner pays the last 18 months back; the ministry
-- indemnifies beyond them, up to 5½ years — 7 years in all.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_h__subpara_2
GIVEN `months of retroactive pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months the ministry indemnifies` `months of retroactive pay` IS
    min 66 (max 0 (`months of retroactive pay` MINUS 18))

#ASSERT 18 PLUS 66 EQUALS 7 TIMES 12
#ASSERT `months the ministry indemnifies` 100 EQUALS 66

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5__para_h__subpara_2/p2
`the indemnity arrangement runs from` MEANS 19930101

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_1_5/p4 The sources of 1.26.1.5 (אסמכתא): director-general and personnel-division circulars.

§§ `1.26.2 מענק השתלמות`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p1 Heading "1. כללי"; its rules follow.

-- 1.26.2 1.1: by the wage agreements, teachers studying in suitable
-- frameworks may ask for hours grants or a share in tuition, up to the
-- tuition of Israel's universities.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p2
GIVEN `tuition charged` IS A NUMBER, `Israeli university tuition` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most tuition refunded` `tuition charged` `Israeli university tuition` IS
    min `tuition charged` `Israeli university tuition`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p3 Heading "1.2 עובדי הוראה במסגרת \"אופק חדש\""; its rules follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p4
`an Ofek Hadash teacher must hold a first degree` MEANS TRUE

DECLARE `kind of grant` IS ONE OF
    `an hours grant`
    `a tuition refund`

DECLARE `degree studied` IS ONE OF
    `a B.A. or B.Ed`
    `a further degree`

-- 1.2.2-1.2.4: an Ofek Hadash teacher may ask for a tuition refund only;
-- one without a degree only for a B.A. or B.Ed — even after using up every
-- grant; one with a degree as below.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p5
GIVEN `in Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN, `has a first degree` IS A BOOLEAN, k IS A `kind of grant`, d IS A `degree studied`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the kind of grant is open to the teacher` `in Ofek Hadash` `has a first degree` k d IF
    IF `in Ofek Hadash`
    THEN k EQUALS `a tuition refund` AND (`has a first degree` OR d EQUALS `a B.A. or B.Ed`)
    ELSE TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p5
GIVEN `in Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN, `has a first degree` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A `degree studied`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the career ceiling applies` `in Ofek Hadash` `has a first degree` d IF
    NOT (`in Ofek Hadash` AND (NOT `has a first degree`) AND d EQUALS `a B.A. or B.Ed`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p6
`certified vocational instructors and technology teachers studying for technician, engineer or the degrees below may ask` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p7
DECLARE `study institution` IS ONE OF
    `an institution of higher education recognised by the Council for Higher Education`
    `the Open University`
    `the academic track of a teacher-training college`
    `a framework recognised for grants by the professional development division`
    `the Israeli branch of a foreign university`
    `another institution`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p9
GIVEN i IS A `study institution`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the institution counts for grants` i IF
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the Israeli branch of a foreign university` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `another institution` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p8
GIVEN `for an equivalent degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `a B.Ed, grade 1 or M.Ed equivalent at a supervised Haredi college, approved one by one` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `equivalent-degree studies count for grants` `for an equivalent degree` `a B.Ed, grade 1 or M.Ed equivalent at a supervised Haredi college, approved one by one` IF
    (NOT `for an equivalent degree`) OR `a B.Ed, grade 1 or M.Ed equivalent at a supervised Haredi college, approved one by one`

-- 1.7-1.9: over a career at most 12 grant hours or three full tuitions; one
-- unit more for a master's or a doctorate. An hour is a quarter tuition.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p10 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p11
GIVEN `studies for a master's or a doctorate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `career ceiling in grant hours` `studies for a master's or a doctorate` IS
    IF `studies for a master's or a doctorate` THEN 16 ELSE 12

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p12
GIVEN `grant hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `share of a tuition the hours are worth` `grant hours` IS
    BRANCH
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p13
        IF `grant hours` EQUALS 1 THEN 1/4
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p14
        IF `grant hours` EQUALS 2 THEN 1/2
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p15
        IF `grant hours` EQUALS 3 THEN 3/4
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p16
        IF `grant hours` EQUALS 4 THEN 1
        OTHERWISE `grant hours` DIVIDED BY 4

#ASSERT `career ceiling in grant hours` FALSE TIMES `share of a tuition the hours are worth` 1 EQUALS 3

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p17
GIVEN `kinds received in one school year` IS A LIST OF `kind of grant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year's grants are allowed together` `kinds received in one school year` IF
    NOT (elem `an hours grant` `kinds received in one school year` AND elem `a tuition refund` `kinds received in one school year`)

-- 1.11-1.12: grants are given within the budget, by the priorities of 3.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p18 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_1_26_2/p19
GIVEN `grants asked in order of priority` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `budget` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `grants paid within the budget` `grants asked in order of priority` `budget` IS
    min (sum `grants asked in order of priority`) `budget`

-- 1.26.2, 2.1-2.2: who may ask for an hours grant or a tuition refund.
@desc A teacher asking for a grant (1.26.2, 2).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p1
DECLARE `grant applicant` HAS
    `works in an official institution, a post-primary one, or a teacher college that settles accounts with the ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is permanent`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the grant year is the fourth year of teaching` IS A BOOLEAN
    `position fraction that year`           IS A NUMBER
    `works in a local authority's education department` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is temporary or an hourly substitute`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `is in Ofek Hadash`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `on a half sabbatical year`             IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p2
GIVEN a IS A `grant applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may ask for an hours grant` a IF
        a's `works in an official institution, a post-primary one, or a teacher college that settles accounts with the ministry`
    AND (a's `is permanent` OR a's `the grant year is the fourth year of teaching`)
    AND a's `position fraction that year` AT LEAST 1/3
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p3
    AND (NOT a's `works in a local authority's education department`)
    AND (NOT a's `is temporary or an hourly substitute`)
    AND (NOT a's `is in Ofek Hadash`)

-- 2.1.2-2.1.3 (in the same paragraph): the hours of several courses are
-- added up; one employed at two stages is judged by the larger part.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours of each course` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly study hours` `weekly hours of each course` IS sum `weekly hours of each course`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p3
GIVEN `position at the first stage` IS A NUMBER, `position at the second stage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the stage that decides the grant` `position at the first stage` `position at the second stage` IS
    IF `position at the first stage` AT LEAST `position at the second stage` THEN "the first stage" ELSE "the second stage"

-- 2.1.4: allocated by priority, by weekly study hours: 6 hours at least
-- entitle to 2; 9-11 may get 3 and 12 or more may get 4, within the budget.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `grant hours the teacher is entitled to` `weekly hours` IS
    IF `weekly hours` AT LEAST 6 THEN 2 ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `grant hours that may be approved within the budget` `weekly hours` IS
    BRANCH IF `weekly hours` AT LEAST 12 THEN 4
           IF `weekly hours` AT LEAST 9  THEN 3
           IF `weekly hours` AT LEAST 6  THEN 2
           OTHERWISE 0

-- 2.1.4.4: a master's holder writing a thesis, or a special student: hours
-- by the table, and up to 2 hours for writing the thesis.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_1/p5
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `thesis hours asked` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `grant hours for a master's thesis student` `weekly hours` `thesis hours asked` IS
    `grant hours that may be approved within the budget` `weekly hours` PLUS min `thesis hours asked` 2

-- 2.1.4.5: a doctoral student: hours by the table, and for writing the
-- thesis up to 4 hours over all the years, no more than 2 in one year.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_4_5/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_4_5/p2
GIVEN `writing hours asked this year` IS A NUMBER, `writing hours granted before` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `doctoral writing hours that may be approved` `writing hours asked this year` `writing hours granted before` IS
    max 0 (min (min `writing hours asked this year` 2) (4 MINUS `writing hours granted before`))

-- 2.1.4.5 note: an Open University course of 6 credit points equals 4
-- weekly hours (F-1.26-c).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_1_4_5/p3
GIVEN `Open University credit points` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly hours for Open University credits` `Open University credit points` IS
    `Open University credit points` TIMES 4 DIVIDED BY 6

-- F-1.26-c: the same Open University course of 6 credit points is 6 units
-- under 1.26.1.2 יד and one unit's worth (4 weekly yearly hours) under 2.1.4.5.
`6 Open University credit points, in units, by 1.26.1.2 יד` MEANS
    `Open University units and pooled hours` 6 0 DIVIDED BY `single hours in a unit`
`6 Open University credit points, in units, by 1.26.2` MEANS
    `weekly hours for Open University credits` 6 DIVIDED BY `weekly yearly hours in a unit`

`the two clauses value an Open University credit point differently` MEANS
    NOT (`6 Open University credit points, in units, by 1.26.1.2 יד` EQUALS `6 Open University credit points, in units, by 1.26.2`)
#ASSERT `the two clauses value an Open University credit point differently`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_2_1/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_2_1/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_2_1/p4
GIVEN a IS A `grant applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may ask for a tuition refund` a IF
        a's `works in an official institution, a post-primary one, or a teacher college that settles accounts with the ministry`
    AND (a's `is permanent` OR a's `the grant year is the fourth year of teaching`)
    AND a's `position fraction that year` AT LEAST 1/2
    AND (NOT a's `works in a local authority's education department`)
    AND (NOT a's `is temporary or an hourly substitute`)

-- 2.2.1: a teacher on a half sabbatical may ask, and gets at most 50% of
-- the tuition charged.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_2_1/p3
GIVEN a IS A `grant applicant`, `tuition charged` IS A NUMBER, `refund otherwise due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `tuition refund` a `tuition charged` `refund otherwise due` IS
    IF a's `on a half sabbatical year`
    THEN min `refund otherwise due` (`tuition charged` TIMES 0.5)
    ELSE `refund otherwise due`

-- 2.2.2 (in the same paragraph): the ministry handles only a refund where at
-- least 15% of the full tuition was charged — 10% for a doctorate.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_2_2_1/p4
GIVEN `share of the full tuition charged` IS A NUMBER, `for a doctorate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ministry handles the refund` `share of the full tuition charged` `for a doctorate` IF
    IF `for a doctorate`
    THEN `share of the full tuition charged` AT LEAST 0.10
    ELSE `share of the full tuition charged` AT LEAST 0.15

-- 3: the order of priority, and the tracks approved for grants. All but
-- "3.7 and 3.15" must be academic tracks under the Council for Higher
-- Education; 3.15 is read as 3.14, the yeshivas (F-1.26-e).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3/p1
GIVEN `priority` IS A NUMBER, `external or certificate studies` IS A BOOLEAN, `academic track under the Council for Higher Education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the studies are recognised for a grant` `priority` `external or certificate studies` `academic track under the Council for Higher Education` IF
        (NOT `external or certificate studies`)
    AND (`academic track under the Council for Higher Education` OR `priority` EQUALS 7 OR `priority` EQUALS 14)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3/p3 The headers of the table of priorities ("הסמל", "מסלול הלימודים"); no rule.

DECLARE `priority track` HAS
    `priority number`   IS A NUMBER
    `track`             IS A STRING

`the priorities` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_1
        `priority track` 1  "certification as a certified teacher at a college or seminary",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_2
        `priority track` 2  "certification as a senior teacher at a college or seminary (not for a salary grade)",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_3
        `priority track` 3  "a first teaching certificate at an institution of higher education (middle or post-primary teachers)",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_4
        `priority track` 4  "a first degree, B.A./B.Ed, in technological education, for those without one",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_5
        `priority track` 5  "a master's degree in technological education, for those without one",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_6
        `priority track` 6  "frontal weekly hours towards a doctorate, for those without one",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_7
        `priority track` 7  "studies the ministry builds for its own needs",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_8
        `priority track` 8  "completion studies for admission to a master's degree",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_9
        `priority track` 9  "thesis studies or writing in a master's, for admission to a doctorate",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_10
        `priority track` 10 "writing a doctoral thesis",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_11
        `priority track` 11 "a further parallel degree for holders of a master's or a doctorate (not a second B.A.)",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_12
        `priority track` 12 "a further teaching certificate, a further age group included, in a B.Ed track",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_13
        `priority track` 13 "the master's and doctoral studies of 3.8-3.11 for those who used up their grants",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_14
        `priority track` 14 "studies towards rabbinical ordination at approved yeshivas"

-- F-1.26-e: 3 excepts "priorities 3.7 and 3.15" from the academic rule,
-- and the list ends at 3.14.
`priority 3.15 exists` MEANS
    elem 15 (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `priority number`) `the priorities`)
`3 cites a priority 3.15 the list does not have` MEANS NOT `priority 3.15 exists`
#ASSERT `3 cites a priority 3.15 the list does not have`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_14/p1 Heading "הערות"; the notes follow.

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_14__para_a
GIVEN `priority` IS A NUMBER, `attached a copy of the first teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a further-certificate request is complete` `priority` `attached a copy of the first teaching certificate` IF
    (NOT `priority` EQUALS 12) OR `attached a copy of the first teaching certificate`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_3_14__para_b
GIVEN `holds an equivalent grade` IS A BOOLEAN, `attached the division's confirmation of it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an equivalent-grade holder may ask, not as a double degree` `holds an equivalent grade` `attached the division's confirmation of it` IF
    `holds an equivalent grade` AND `attached the division's confirmation of it`

-- 4.1: the duties and rights of one whose grant was approved.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_1_1
GIVEN `fare by public transport` IS A NUMBER, `an urban journey` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `travel refunded by the owner` `fare by public transport` `an urban journey` IS
    IF `an urban journey` THEN 0 ELSE `fare by public transport`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_1_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `reporting a change in the studies` IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    MUST  `notify a change in the study plan`
    HENCE (PARTY `the professional development division` MAY `stop the grant`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_1_1
GIVEN `the grant was cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN, `because the ministry cancelled a course it sent him to` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may plead a reduced position that year` `the grant was cancelled` `because the ministry cancelled a course it sent him to` IF
    (NOT `the grant was cancelled`) OR `because the ministry cancelled a course it sent him to`

-- 4.1.5: one unit of grant (4 hours, or a full tuition) commits to one more
-- year of teaching.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_1_1
GIVEN `grant hours received` IS A NUMBER, `full tuitions received` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `further years of teaching committed` `grant hours received` `full tuitions received` IS
    `grant hours received` DIVIDED BY 4 PLUS `full tuitions received`

-- 4.2: the grant hours are part of the position; the position need not be
-- cut by them while the whole stays within 140%; hours above the permanent
-- position give no tenure; studies stopped mid-year stop the grant and the
-- travel refund from the first of the next month.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_2_1
GIVEN `permanent position` IS A NUMBER, `grant hours as a share of a position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position the teacher must give up for the grant` `permanent position` `grant hours as a share of a position` IS
    max 0 (`permanent position` PLUS `grant hours as a share of a position` MINUS 1.4)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_2_1
`grant hours beyond the permanent position give tenure in them` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_2_1
GIVEN `school month the studies stopped` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `school month the grant stops` `school month the studies stopped` IS `school month the studies stopped` PLUS 1

-- 4.3: who pays the hours grant, and the accounts with the owners.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_3_1
GIVEN `is a state employee` IS A BOOLEAN, `the owner settles accounts with the ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `who pays the hours grant` `is a state employee` `the owner settles accounts with the ministry` IS
    IF `is a state employee` THEN "the Ministry of Education"
    ELSE IF `the owner settles accounts with the ministry` THEN "the owner, refunded by the ministry"
         ELSE "outside this arrangement"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_3_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `the ministry's payments to the owners` IS
         (PARTY `the ministry`
          MUST  `pay the first grant instalment` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month number` October
          WITHIN `month number` October)
    RAND (PARTY `the ownership`
          MUST  `report the grants paid` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month number` May
          WITHIN `month number` May
          LEST  BREACH BY `the ownership` BECAUSE "4.3.4: an owner that did not declare has payments deducted")
    RAND (PARTY `the ministry`
          MUST  `settle the final account` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month number` July
          WITHIN `month number` July)

-- 4.4: the tuition refund, a month after the original receipts.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_4_1
DECLARE `payment to the institution` IS ONE OF
    `tuition`
    `the education levy`
    `registration fees`
    `payments for services`
    `interest for late payment`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_4_1
GIVEN p IS A `payment to the institution`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is refunded` p IF p EQUALS `tuition`

-- 4.4.1.1-2: the district treasury refunds a state employee, the owner of
-- the institution anyone else, a month after the original receipts.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_4_1
GIVEN `month the receipts were delivered` IS A NUMBER, `is a state employee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `refunding tuition` `month the receipts were delivered` `is a state employee` IS
    IF `is a state employee`
    THEN PARTY `the district treasury`
         MUST  `refund the tuition` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month the receipts were delivered` PLUS 1
         WITHIN 1
    ELSE PARTY `the ownership`
         MUST  `refund the tuition` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month the receipts were delivered` PLUS 1
         WITHIN 1

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_4_4_1
`tax is deducted from the refund as the law requires` MEANS TRUE

-- 5.1: one request only, to the district where most hours are worked.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_1_1
GIVEN `hours by district` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours in the district the request goes to` `hours by district` IS maximum `hours by district`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_1_1
GIVEN `in recognised non-official education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `where the grant request is sent` `in recognised non-official education` IS
    IF `in recognised non-official education`
    THEN "the owner paying the salary, which sends them together to the division"
    ELSE "the district professional-development supervisor"

-- 5.2 and 5.3: the dates. The deadlines are published (usually mid-May for
-- hours, mid-November for tuition); conditional hours approvals by the end
-- of June; the computerised transcript in November, or the grant is
-- cancelled and what was paid is deducted; tuition approvals in January.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_2_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `the November transcript` IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    MUST  `deliver the transcript` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month number` November
    WITHIN `month number` November
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teacher` BECAUSE "5.2.3: without the transcript the grant is cancelled and what was paid is deducted from the salary"

@desc A request for an hours grant, on one timeline of days (placeholder dates where the text has none).
DECLARE `hours-grant request` HAS
    `day it arrived`                     IS A NUMBER
    `the published deadline`             IS A NUMBER @desc published on the ministry's site, "usually mid-May"; an input
    `end of the second week of studies`  IS A NUMBER @desc at the institutions of higher education; an input

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_2_1
GIVEN r IS A `hours-grant request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request is in time` r IF
    r's `day it arrived` AT MOST r's `the published deadline`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_2_1
GIVEN r IS A `hours-grant request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request is returned unhandled` r IF
    r's `day it arrived` GREATER THAN r's `end of the second week of studies`

-- F-1.26-f: a request after the published deadline and before the end of
-- the second week of studies is neither in time nor to be returned.
-- Placeholder days: deadline day 135, second week ending day 300, arrival 200.
`a request in August` MEANS `hours-grant request` WITH
    `day it arrived`                    IS 200
    `the published deadline`            IS 135
    `end of the second week of studies` IS 300

-- The reading adopted (F-1.26-f): the published deadline governs; a later
-- request is handled only in a further round announced for spare budget
-- (6.3's note), and never after the second week of studies.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_2_1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p1
GIVEN r IS A `hours-grant request`, `a further round was announced` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request is handled` r `a further round was announced` IF
        `the request is in time` r
    OR  (`a further round was announced` AND (NOT `the request is returned unhandled` r))

`a late request before the cut-off is neither in time nor returned` MEANS
    (NOT `the request is in time` `a request in August`) AND (NOT `the request is returned unhandled` `a request in August`)
#ASSERT `a late request before the cut-off is neither in time nor returned`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_5_3_1
DECLARE `tuition request` HAS
    `with the computerised transcript`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `with the tuition charged`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `writes a thesis`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `with the confirmation of the thesis tuition` IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed as the institution requires`       IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN t IS A `tuition request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the tuition request is complete` t IF
        t's `with the computerised transcript`
    AND t's `with the tuition charged`
    AND ((NOT t's `writes a thesis`) OR t's `with the confirmation of the thesis tuition`)
    AND t's `signed as the institution requires`

-- 6: a special committee weighs rejected requests outside the priorities,
-- where the studies bear directly on the teacher's work; applications by the
-- first Sunday of October (hours) or of February (tuition), through the
-- district training supervisor (6.3).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_1
GIVEN `rejected and outside the priorities` IS A BOOLEAN, `bears directly on the teacher's work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the exceptions committee may weigh it` `rejected and outside the priorities` `bears directly on the teacher's work` IF
    `rejected and outside the priorities` AND `bears directly on the teacher's work`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_2/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_2/p2
GIVEN k IS A `kind of grant`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `applying to the exceptions committee` k IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    MAY   `apply to the exceptions committee` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `the exceptions deadline month` k
    WITHIN `the exceptions deadline month` k

GIVEN g IS A `kind of grant`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the exceptions deadline month` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `an hours grant` THEN `month number` October
    WHEN `a tuition refund` THEN `month number` February

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p1
GIVEN `budget left after the approvals` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a further round of requests is announced` `budget left after the approvals` IF
    `budget left after the approvals` GREATER THAN 0

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p3 The source of 1.26.2 (אסמכתא): a director-general circular.

§§ `1.26.3 קרנות השתלמות`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p6 The heading of 1.26.3 (which the corpus prints inside 1.26.2's last subsection), its update note (15.9.03) and the heading "המסלול הרגיל"; the rules follow.

@desc A teacher's membership of a training fund (1.26.3).
DECLARE `fund member` HAS
    `salary for the fund`                 IS A NUMBER @desc the combined salary plus the additions recognised as permanent for pension
    `fund position fraction`              IS A NUMBER
    `years saved`                         IS A NUMBER
    `completed a saving period`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `age`                                 IS A NUMBER
    `fund member seniority`               IS A NUMBER
    `went on a training year before`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a master's or more`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a first degree`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a senior certified teacher`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a principal or supervisor`        IS A BOOLEAN

-- Regular track 1-3: monthly payments through the employer, with the
-- employer's share, to the fund's account within a month of the salary;
-- the teacher pays 4.2% of the salary (up to 150% of a position), the
-- employer 8.4% — double, or as the management decides.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p8 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p9
GIVEN `month the salary was paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `passing the payments to the fund` `month the salary was paid` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay into the training fund` m PROVIDED m AT MOST `month the salary was paid` PLUS 1
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "1.26.3, 1ג: payments reach the fund's bank account within a month of the salary"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p10 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p11
GIVEN m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teacher's monthly payment to the fund` m IS
    0.042 TIMES m's `salary for the fund` TIMES min (m's `fund position fraction`) 1.5

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p10 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p11
GIVEN m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's monthly payment to the fund` m IS
    2 TIMES `the teacher's monthly payment to the fund` m

#ASSERT 2 TIMES 0.042 EQUALS 0.084

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p11
GIVEN `deducted` IS A NUMBER, `due at 4.2%` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shortfall to complete before the training` `deducted` `due at 4.2%` IS
    max 0 (`due at 4.2%` MINUS `deducted`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p12
`after a saving period the teacher may join another plan` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p13
`the saving periods the text names` MEANS LIST 7, 8

-- 4א-ב: one who paid as due and met the conditions may go on training leave
-- of up to a full school year per saving period, on the committee's approval
-- and the employer's confirmation of unpaid leave; the grant is 66.66% of
-- the salary, 77.77% after 7 years' saving, 88.88% after 8.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p14
GIVEN `paid as due` IS A BOOLEAN, `the committee approved the leave and plan` IS A BOOLEAN, `the employer confirmed unpaid leave` IS A BOOLEAN, `months of leave` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may go on training leave` `paid as due` `the committee approved the leave and plan` `the employer confirmed unpaid leave` `months of leave` IF
    `paid as due` AND `the committee approved the leave and plan` AND `the employer confirmed unpaid leave` AND `months of leave` AT MOST 12

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p15
GIVEN `years saved` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `training grant percent of the salary` `years saved` IS
    BRANCH IF `years saved` AT LEAST 8 THEN 88.88
           IF `years saved` AT LEAST 7 THEN 77.77
           OTHERWISE 66.66

-- F-1.26-g: the base saving period, which the 66.66% rate is for, is never
-- stated; the rates step by 11.11 a year, which puts it at 6 years — a
-- length the text names nowhere.
`the saving period the base rate implies` MEANS 66.66 DIVIDED BY 11.11
`the base saving period is not stated` MEANS
    NOT elem `the saving period the base rate implies` `the saving periods the text names`
#ASSERT `the base saving period is not stated`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p16
GIVEN `tuition paid` IS A NUMBER, `studied abroad` IS A BOOLEAN, `Israeli university tuition` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `tuition the fund refunds` `tuition paid` `studied abroad` `Israeli university tuition` IS
    IF `studied abroad` THEN min `tuition paid` `Israeli university tuition` ELSE `tuition paid`

-- 4ד: flexible training for those the management finds cannot go, on
-- these degrees and seniorities, while all such are at most 1.5% of the
-- year's trainees.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p17
GIVEN m IS A `fund member`, `flexible trainees share of the year's trainees` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may go on flexible training` m `flexible trainees share of the year's trainees` IF
        `has the degree and seniority for flexible training` m
    AND `flexible trainees share of the year's trainees` AT MOST 0.015

GIVEN m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the degree and seniority for flexible training` m IF
        m's `has a master's or more`
    OR  (m's `holds a first degree` AND m's `fund member seniority` AT LEAST 20)
    OR  (m's `is a senior certified teacher` AND m's `fund member seniority` AT LEAST 25)
    OR  m's `is a principal or supervisor`

-- 5: the training year counts for seniority and pension; the fund buys the
-- pension rights on the grant's salary and the average position.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p18
`the training year counts as a year of seniority and of pension` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p18
GIVEN `salary of the grant` IS A NUMBER, `average position` IS A NUMBER, `pension rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pension contributions the fund bears` `salary of the grant` `average position` `pension rate` IS
    `salary of the grant` TIMES `average position` TIMES `pension rate`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p19
GIVEN `training year before 1973` IS A BOOLEAN, `needed to reach 70% pension` IS A BOOLEAN, `retired after 1.4.78` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the fund buys pension for an early training year` `training year before 1973` `needed to reach 70% pension` `retired after 1.4.78` IF
    `training year before 1973` AND `needed to reach 70% pension` AND `retired after 1.4.78`

-- 5ג: the recuperation allowance in the training year by seniority "on the
-- grading above" (F-1.26-h) and the average position. The days are the
-- recuperation table's (section 1.7), an input here.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p20
GIVEN `recuperation days for the seniority` IS A NUMBER, `daily recuperation cost` IS A NUMBER, `average position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation in the training year` `recuperation days for the seniority` `daily recuperation cost` `average position` IS
    `recuperation days for the seniority` TIMES `daily recuperation cost` TIMES `average position`

-- F-1.26-h: no grading of recuperation by seniority stands above 5ג in 1.26.
`the gradings 1.26 sets out before the training funds` MEANS
    LIST "regular units by year (1.26.1.0)", "middle-school course hours to units (6א)",
         "pedagogical courses to units (6ב)", "grant hours by weekly study hours (2.1.4)"
`"the grading above" for recuperation is not in 1.26` MEANS
    NOT elem "recuperation days by seniority" `the gradings 1.26 sets out before the training funds`
#ASSERT `"the grading above" for recuperation is not in 1.26`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p21
GIVEN `National Insurance paid` IS A NUMBER, `student or minimum rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `National Insurance the fund refunds` `National Insurance paid` `student or minimum rate` IS
    min `National Insurance paid` `student or minimum rate`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p22
GIVEN `months from the training year to the birth` IS A NUMBER, `entitled to National Insurance maternity pay` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the fund pays maternity pay` `months from the training year to the birth` `entitled to National Insurance maternity pay` IF
    `months from the training year to the birth` AT MOST 10 AND (NOT `entitled to National Insurance maternity pay`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p23
GIVEN `months from the leave to the call-up` IS A NUMBER, `had pay or support from another source` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the fund pays for reserve duty after the leave` `months from the leave to the call-up` `had pay or support from another source` IF
    `months from the leave to the call-up` AT MOST 3 AND (NOT `had pay or support from another source`)

-- 6ג: whether an accident in training is a work accident is decided case by
-- case; neither answer holds in general.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p24
GIVEN `the case's own finding` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an accident in training is a work accident` `the case's own finding` IF `the case's own finding`

-- 7א: work during the training: up to 1/3 of a position in a full year,
-- 2/3 in a half year; one who works part-time may save on the short track,
-- the employers paying 7.5% against the teacher's 2.5%, given the tax
-- approvals.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p25
GIVEN `a full training year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `most position worked during the training` `a full training year` IS
    IF `a full training year` THEN 1/3 ELSE 2/3

-- 7ב: one who falls ill and stops gets sick leave at the regular workplace,
-- the rest of the rights frozen (see 1.25.3, 7).
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p26
GIVEN `fell ill and the grant stopped` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `gets sick leave and the remaining rights are frozen` `fell ill and the grant stopped` IF `fell ill and the grant stopped`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p27
GIVEN `severance received` IS A NUMBER, `severance had the training year counted` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fund completes the severance by` `severance received` `severance had the training year counted` IS
    max 0 (`severance had the training year counted` MINUS `severance received`)

-- 8: before leaving, a written undertaking to keep working 3 years after the
-- leave (2 of them with the last employer); breaking it, the teacher repays
-- what was received less his own savings, with interest and indexation,
-- less expenses; he may appeal the duty to repay. Time in months from the
-- end of the leave.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p28 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p29 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p30
GIVETH A DEONTIC `1.26 party` `training action`
DECIDE `working on after the training` IS
    PARTY `the teacher`
    SHANT `leave the teaching service` n
    WITHIN 36
    LEST  (PARTY `the teacher`
           MUST  `repay the fund`
           LEST  (PARTY `the teacher` MAY `appeal the repayment`))

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p29
GIVEN `received in the training` IS A NUMBER, `own savings` IS A NUMBER, `interest and indexation` IS A NUMBER, `expenses` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the sum to repay` `received in the training` `own savings` `interest and indexation` `expenses` IS
    max 0 (`received in the training` MINUS `own savings` PLUS `interest and indexation` MINUS `expenses`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p28
GIVEN `stays 3 years at an institution of another owner` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `a release from returning to the same institution` `stays 3 years at an institution of another owner` IS
    IF `stays 3 years at an institution of another owner` THEN "discussed by the fund's secretariat" ELSE "not asked"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p31
GIVEN `an exceptional case` IS A BOOLEAN, `years earlier` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the training may be brought forward` `an exceptional case` `years earlier` IF
    `an exceptional case` AND `years earlier` AT MOST 1

-- 10: leaving the fund, and what is paid out.
DECLARE `way out of the fund` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p32
    `ending the membership`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p34
    `retirement on pension`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p35
    `death, to the heirs`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p37
    `a completed period at 55`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p38
    `a completed period at 50 or with 15 years' seniority, after a training year`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p39
    `a completed period and dismissal`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p40
    `a completed period and retirement for a work disability National Insurance recognises`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p41
    `a completed period and a move to public education administration or elected office`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p42
    `a completed period and special medical or economic hardship the management finds`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p32 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p33 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p36 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p43
GIVEN w IS A `way out of the fund`, `own savings` IS A NUMBER, `employer's share` IS A NUMBER, `expenses` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `paid out on leaving the fund` w `own savings` `employer's share` `expenses` IS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `ending the membership` THEN `own savings` MINUS `expenses`
    WHEN `retirement on pension` THEN `own savings` PLUS `employer's share` MINUS `expenses`
    WHEN `death, to the heirs` THEN `own savings` PLUS `employer's share` MINUS `expenses`
    OTHERWISE (`own savings` PLUS 0.89 TIMES `employer's share`) TIMES 0.97

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p43
`the employer's payments go back to the employer when a member leaves` MEANS FALSE

-- 11: freezing the rights.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p44
DECLARE `freeze request` HAS
    `asked in writing with reasons`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaches or is on unpaid leave meanwhile` IS A BOOLEAN
    `months asked`                           IS A NUMBER
    `on unpaid leave the employer approves`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `will make up the differences on return` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p44
GIVEN f IS A `freeze request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the freeze may be approved` f IF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p45
        f's `asked in writing with reasons`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p46
    AND f's `teaches or is on unpaid leave meanwhile`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p47
    AND (f's `months asked` AT MOST 36 OR f's `on unpaid leave the employer approves`)
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p48
    AND f's `will make up the differences on return`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p49 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p50 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p51
GIVEN `months without payments` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `after a stop in payments` `months without payments` IS
    IF `months without payments` AT MOST 4
    THEN "may restore the rights by paying the debt with indexation and interest"
    ELSE "a written warning; the management may at its absolute discretion take the rights away"

-- 12-14: investments, loans and the management's powers; no assignment of
-- rights except the loans.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p52 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p53
`the fund invests by its regulations and lends by the constitutional arrangement` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p54
GIVEN `for a loan of the fund` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the fund recognises an assignment or pledge of the rights` `for a loan of the fund` IF `for a loan of the fund`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p55
`the management may do whatever the plan obliges or allows the fund to do` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p56 Heading "המסלול המקוצר (קרן \"מקור\" קרן \"מישור\")"; its rules follow.

@desc A teacher joining the short track.
DECLARE `short-track applicant` HAS
    `paid on the teachers' scale`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employer pays its share`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `in another training fund`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `may join the regular track`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the teachers' scale but not teaching, the employer undertaking its share` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p57
GIVEN s IS A `short-track applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may join the short track` s IF
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p58
        s's `paid on the teachers' scale`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p59
    AND s's `the employer pays its share`
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p60
    AND (NOT s's `in another training fund`)
    @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p61
    AND ((NOT s's `may join the regular track`) OR s's `on the teachers' scale but not teaching, the employer undertaking its share`)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p62 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p25
GIVEN `salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the short track's monthly payments` `salary` IS
    `salary` TIMES (0.025 PLUS 0.075)

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p63 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p64 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p65
GIVEN `years saved on the short track` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `a short-track saver may withdraw` `years saved on the short track` IS
    BRANCH IF `years saved on the short track` AT LEAST 6 THEN "everything, with no training required"
           IF `years saved on the short track` AT LEAST 3 THEN "everything, with a short training the committee approves; no unpaid leave needed"
           OTHERWISE "nothing yet"

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p66
`otherwise the short track follows the fund's regulations` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p67
`the short track's money is a closed fund apart from the regular track` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p68 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p69 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p70 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p71 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p72 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_26__ssec_6_3/p73 The sources of 1.26.3 (אסמכתא): the 1962 memorandum and the funds' regulations, collective agreements, circulars and a legal opinion.

-- Worked examples. Every figure is a placeholder, not from any payslip:
-- a combined salary of 10,000 and a full position.
`a member saving 7 years` MEANS
    `fund member` WITH
        `salary for the fund`        IS 10000
        `fund position fraction`     IS 1
        `years saved`                IS 7
        `completed a saving period`  IS TRUE
        `age`                        IS 52
        `fund member seniority`      IS 22
        `went on a training year before` IS FALSE
        `has a master's or more`     IS FALSE
        `holds a first degree`       IS TRUE
        `is a senior certified teacher` IS FALSE
        `is a principal or supervisor` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the teacher's monthly payment to the fund` `a member saving 7 years` EQUALS 420
#ASSERT `the employer's monthly payment to the fund` `a member saving 7 years` EQUALS 840
#ASSERT `training grant percent of the salary` 7 EQUALS 77.77
#ASSERT `may go on flexible training` `a member saving 7 years` 0.01
#ASSERT `training allowance percent` 19980901 10 TRUE FALSE EQUALS 22.5
#ASSERT `doctoral writing hours that may be approved` 2 3 EQUALS 1
#EVAL   `paid out on leaving the fund` `a completed period at 55` 1000 2000 0

-- The training-leave undertaking: still teaching 36 months on, kept;
-- leaving after 20 months, the duty to repay arises.
#TRACE `working on after the training` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teacher` DOES `appeal the repayment` AT 40
#TRACE `working on after the training` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teacher` DOES `leave the teaching service` 20 AT 20
